1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:02:03,700
Please contact turkision@gmail.com for any inquiries

2
00:02:03,970 --> 00:02:08,120
No living being was harmed
during the filming of this series.

3
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:12,170
Episode 107

4
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:14,510
You can't escape from my grasp.

5
00:02:23,450 --> 00:02:25,440
My Allah, help us.

6
00:03:09,640 --> 00:03:12,040
Alps, prepare defense measures with fire.

7
00:03:12,290 --> 00:03:14,000
Wait for my order!

8
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:45,930
Do it now!

9
00:04:10,100 --> 00:04:12,129
Don't leave any of them alive.

10
00:04:28,290 --> 00:04:29,810
Oh right!

11
00:04:41,420 --> 00:04:43,800
Your punishment will be worse than this.

12
00:05:00,950 --> 00:05:02,840
We demolished their headquarters, Olof.

13
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:04,460
We have to go.

14
00:05:05,340 --> 00:05:07,090
This is just the beginning.

15
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:10,950
They will pay for every
drop of blood they shed.

16
00:05:11,470 --> 00:05:13,680
We'll make them pay, Olof.
We'll do it together.

17
00:05:13,930 --> 00:05:16,550
But not now,
not now.

18
00:05:23,460 --> 00:05:25,000
We will back off.

19
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:42,470
What is this headquarters, Osman Bey?

20
00:05:42,870 --> 00:05:45,570
From whom did you obtain permission
to establish a headquarters?

21
00:05:45,820 --> 00:05:46,940
From Allah.

22
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:55,740
I do not take permission from
anyone to fight for the truth.

23
00:05:59,610 --> 00:06:01,190
If you don't know me...

24
00:06:02,540 --> 00:06:04,150
ask who is next to you.

25
00:06:06,850 --> 00:06:08,800
He knows me well.

26
00:06:09,550 --> 00:06:11,650
You are wronging me, Osman Bey.

27
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:13,470
I totally give you your right.

28
00:06:18,370 --> 00:06:19,880
Avcı Bey.

29
00:06:20,740 --> 00:06:23,190
Go to the headquarters
with our soldiers.

30
00:06:24,170 --> 00:06:29,200
Help those who have been hurt for the
sake of those who see daydreaming.

31
00:06:30,530 --> 00:06:31,550
No.

32
00:06:35,350 --> 00:06:38,370
We don't need anyone's help.

33
00:06:39,750 --> 00:06:43,100
You spoil the reconciliation
between the two countries.

34
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:46,690
And on top of that, you get raided.

35
00:06:47,450 --> 00:06:49,900
You will pay for it.

36
00:06:50,700 --> 00:06:52,690
We pay the price no matter what.

37
00:06:53,330 --> 00:06:56,920
Whenever you want and wherever you want.

38
00:07:23,090 --> 00:07:24,020
Turgut Bey.

39
00:07:26,750 --> 00:07:28,110
You stay.

40
00:07:37,880 --> 00:07:39,050
He is going, my Sultan.

41
00:07:39,550 --> 00:07:40,750
What if he arrives early?

42
00:07:40,910 --> 00:07:42,830
He hardly reaches there in the morning.

43
00:07:42,960 --> 00:07:44,000
Upon arrival...

44
00:07:45,110 --> 00:07:46,640
Everyone will be dead.

45
00:07:53,540 --> 00:07:54,780
There you see, right?

46
00:07:56,740 --> 00:07:58,340
What, Sultan?

47
00:07:58,400 --> 00:08:00,480
Osman's arrogance.

48
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:04,290
His arrogance will defeat himself.

49
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:08,230
You have to choose your side now.

50
00:08:09,550 --> 00:08:13,170
Are you next to Osman or next to me?

51
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:43,370
Yenişehir

52
00:08:49,430 --> 00:08:52,120
It is not found anywhere.

53
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:54,780
The warriors at the door don't
know anything.

54
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:56,990
He left Yenişehir in the morning.

55
00:08:57,260 --> 00:08:58,490
He did not come back.

56
00:08:58,540 --> 00:09:00,560
Something must have happened to him.

57
00:09:00,590 --> 00:09:01,500
Yes.

58
00:09:02,050 --> 00:09:04,300
Say good things, Ayşe Hatun.

59
00:09:04,710 --> 00:09:06,280
Perhaps he fled to the tribe.

60
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:07,840
No, Ulgen.

61
00:09:08,170 --> 00:09:10,490
Bengi's daughter had run away, would
she have stood still?

62
00:09:10,570 --> 00:09:12,650
She would already raid the palace.

63
00:09:16,370 --> 00:09:20,170
There she is.
Look.

64
00:09:24,760 --> 00:09:27,950
Speak of the devil.

65
00:09:28,970 --> 00:09:32,050
The woman whose daughter ran away,
would she come to the market?

66
00:09:33,040 --> 00:09:34,700
There is something wrong with it.

67
00:09:35,270 --> 00:09:37,030
There is something wrong with it.

68
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:52,610
Appear before me if you dare.

69
00:09:56,390 --> 00:09:58,090
I will know who you are.

70
00:09:58,260 --> 00:09:59,900
I will know who you are.

71
00:10:05,990 --> 00:10:08,170
Stand before me, you coward dog.

72
00:10:30,890 --> 00:10:32,370
Subasi.

73
00:10:32,580 --> 00:10:34,510
It's your turn.

74
00:10:37,210 --> 00:10:39,650
Torture him well.

75
00:10:42,880 --> 00:10:44,310
Don't worry.

76
00:10:46,190 --> 00:10:47,410
Well.

77
00:10:48,850 --> 00:10:50,790
Let's go to Yenişehir.

78
00:10:51,620 --> 00:10:54,090
They may suspect us if they don't see us.

79
00:10:54,820 --> 00:10:58,300
I am a man who recently got engaged.

80
00:10:58,790 --> 00:11:00,820
I'll go and mind my bu.siness.

81
00:11:00,860 --> 00:11:02,180
Come on.

82
00:11:11,670 --> 00:11:13,300
Take this.

83
00:11:15,410 --> 00:11:17,180
Didn't they run away?

84
00:11:21,930 --> 00:11:23,630
Woe to us!

85
00:11:23,750 --> 00:11:27,090
If Alçiçek is here...

86
00:11:30,750 --> 00:11:32,200
where is Aktemur?

87
00:11:41,180 --> 00:11:43,990
Come, Ülgen, let's find out
something from this girl.

88
00:11:44,580 --> 00:11:45,890
Come on.

89
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:57,850
Ayşe Hatun.

90
00:11:58,960 --> 00:12:00,570
Ülgen Hatun.

91
00:12:01,570 --> 00:12:03,130
What do you want from me?

92
00:12:03,150 --> 00:12:06,000
- Alçiçek, Aktemur...
- My mother is coming.

93
00:12:08,310 --> 00:12:09,880
I don't want her to see you.

94
00:12:12,390 --> 00:12:14,960
Don't mention that name to me again.

95
00:12:15,310 --> 00:12:16,430
That matter is over.

96
00:12:18,700 --> 00:12:20,750
What are you saying, Alçiçek?

97
00:12:22,370 --> 00:12:24,330
I will marry Bayındır Bey.

98
00:12:25,180 --> 00:12:27,000
Get away from me.

99
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:35,950
Walk.

100
00:12:42,880 --> 00:12:44,320
I did not understand anything.

101
00:12:44,520 --> 00:12:45,680
what is happening?

102
00:12:45,990 --> 00:12:50,110
It is clear that Alçiçek
changed her mind.

103
00:12:50,580 --> 00:12:52,290
Oh, Aktemur.

104
00:12:52,710 --> 00:12:54,890
I've decided to go out
on my way, mother.

105
00:12:55,010 --> 00:12:55,680
Or you are...?

106
00:12:55,720 --> 00:12:57,280
I will kidnap Alçiçek.

107
00:12:58,090 --> 00:12:59,470
Did you offer to run away?

108
00:12:59,500 --> 00:13:00,590
She offered it.

109
00:13:02,610 --> 00:13:04,090
When we leave the castle...

110
00:13:04,640 --> 00:13:06,380
She is a brave girl.

111
00:13:07,650 --> 00:13:12,730
Since she loves you so much that
she leaves her parents...

112
00:13:15,190 --> 00:13:16,610
Don't worry.

113
00:13:17,150 --> 00:13:19,410
Go do what you must.

114
00:13:19,810 --> 00:13:21,120
I stand behind you.

115
00:13:28,990 --> 00:13:33,520
I won't make her wait, she's waiting for
me near the compound of pines.

116
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:35,520
Let your path be open.

117
00:13:35,560 --> 00:13:38,490
Be careful, Aktemur.

118
00:13:42,530 --> 00:13:43,460
Sisters!

119
00:13:44,350 --> 00:13:45,980
Aktemur is lost.

120
00:13:46,070 --> 00:13:48,440
Inform Malhun Hatun immediately.

121
00:13:48,450 --> 00:13:50,670
We're going to the place
Aktemur mentioned.

122
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:52,410
Come on, warriors.

123
00:13:52,900 --> 00:13:55,840
Prepare the horses, we're going.

124
00:13:56,490 --> 00:13:57,840
I will come with you too.

125
00:13:58,010 --> 00:13:59,170
I won't leave you alone.

126
00:13:59,190 --> 00:14:01,760
Come, Ülgen.

127
00:14:29,680 --> 00:14:31,260
Alps.

128
00:14:33,710 --> 00:14:35,080
We'll get out quickly.

129
00:14:35,730 --> 00:14:37,960
We will bury our martyrs in Yenişehir.

130
00:14:42,560 --> 00:14:44,560
Osman Bey is coming.

131
00:15:25,500 --> 00:15:27,040
Catapults.

132
00:15:34,670 --> 00:15:36,820
We put a lot of effort into making it.

133
00:15:48,430 --> 00:15:50,060
We made a lot of effort.

134
00:16:06,070 --> 00:16:06,950
Are you well?

135
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:07,990
I'm good.

136
00:16:13,440 --> 00:16:14,590
Bala.

137
00:16:22,960 --> 00:16:23,910
Bala.

138
00:16:29,850 --> 00:16:31,080
Bala.

139
00:16:33,980 --> 00:16:35,580
My Bala.

140
00:16:36,060 --> 00:16:37,790
My brave wife.

141
00:16:38,620 --> 00:16:40,110
Are you well?

142
00:16:40,730 --> 00:16:42,250
I'm fine, Osman.

143
00:16:42,740 --> 00:16:43,810
But...

144
00:16:48,540 --> 00:16:50,750
They completely destroyed the place.

145
00:16:53,750 --> 00:16:55,460
Oh.

146
00:16:55,810 --> 00:16:57,390
Alps.

147
00:17:09,579 --> 00:17:11,560
Is this you how you trust your Bey?

148
00:17:11,730 --> 00:17:12,469
Is it?

149
00:17:14,750 --> 00:17:16,050
Come here.

150
00:17:16,439 --> 00:17:17,640
Come here.

151
00:17:17,790 --> 00:17:20,529
They attacked our headquarters
when we turned our backs.

152
00:17:35,130 --> 00:17:36,690
Get out!

153
00:17:38,990 --> 00:17:40,770
I stand behind you all these years.

154
00:17:41,940 --> 00:17:44,120
Your anger blinded your eyes, Osman Bey.

155
00:17:45,840 --> 00:17:49,240
You kick me out at my first mistake.

156
00:17:52,710 --> 00:17:54,120
Turgut Bey is right.

157
00:17:54,200 --> 00:17:55,750
Go away!

158
00:18:06,480 --> 00:18:07,560
Boran.

159
00:18:08,700 --> 00:18:10,030
Summon the Beys.

160
00:18:10,380 --> 00:18:11,860
I will hold the court.

161
00:18:12,180 --> 00:18:13,710
Your command, my Bey.

162
00:18:18,750 --> 00:18:20,810
They broke our arm.

163
00:18:21,410 --> 00:18:22,970
But we will not stop.

164
00:18:23,720 --> 00:18:26,260
They want to
cut off our head.

165
00:18:27,580 --> 00:18:28,420
Orhan.

166
00:18:28,660 --> 00:18:29,400
My Bey.

167
00:18:30,580 --> 00:18:33,110
Go to Karacahisar with your brother.

168
00:18:33,500 --> 00:18:35,790
Let all Bey draw their swords.

169
00:18:36,210 --> 00:18:38,140
Bring everyone to Yenişehir.

170
00:18:38,630 --> 00:18:39,820
Your command, my Bey.

171
00:18:41,790 --> 00:18:42,790
Bala.

172
00:18:44,760 --> 00:18:47,010
You go with theAlps.

173
00:18:49,710 --> 00:18:52,430
I'll go to someone and then come.

174
00:18:53,210 --> 00:18:54,420
Okay, my Bey.

175
00:18:58,310 --> 00:18:59,780
Come on, Alps.

176
00:19:15,160 --> 00:19:16,800
Valiants.

177
00:19:21,080 --> 00:19:22,500
My Allah.

178
00:19:23,250 --> 00:19:27,320
Grant me the power to take revenge on the
cruels and traitors.

179
00:19:27,540 --> 00:19:28,710
Amin.

180
00:19:35,880 --> 00:19:39,120
Söğüt

181
00:19:39,910 --> 00:19:42,040
Send word to Olof and Bayındır Bey.

182
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:45,090
Let them come to hear my new commands.

183
00:19:46,770 --> 00:19:49,510
I'm going to need Olof
more than I thought.

184
00:19:50,010 --> 00:19:53,450
Are you really going to give
Marmaracık to Olof?

185
00:19:54,960 --> 00:19:56,840
That's what that idiot thinks.

186
00:19:58,110 --> 00:20:00,710
But I will not give him any land.

187
00:20:02,070 --> 00:20:04,090
When my work with Osman ends...

188
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:06,780
I'm done with Olof.

189
00:20:07,320 --> 00:20:08,290
What about Osman?

190
00:20:09,170 --> 00:20:12,130
What will your next move
be for him, my lady?

191
00:20:12,940 --> 00:20:16,110
I will create a big hell for Osman.

192
00:20:16,960 --> 00:20:18,760
A loneliness hell.

193
00:20:19,850 --> 00:20:22,840
His friends and his people...

194
00:20:23,200 --> 00:20:25,820
even his family...

195
00:20:26,260 --> 00:20:28,020
They will not stay with him.

196
00:20:38,700 --> 00:20:43,260
I will make the winds of
poverty blow on Yenişehir.

197
00:20:45,430 --> 00:20:49,860
Osman Bey's people will
suffer from hunger.

198
00:20:51,300 --> 00:20:52,930
And they will turn to me.

199
00:20:55,340 --> 00:20:57,810
They will turn their backs on Osman.

200
00:20:59,820 --> 00:21:04,510
Those who turn their backs on Osman
will be on my side.

201
00:21:05,860 --> 00:21:12,230
Sultan Mother will protect Yenişehir.

202
00:21:17,130 --> 00:21:19,660
İnegöl Castle

203
00:21:41,880 --> 00:21:45,260
Check warehouses
so that there is no shortage.

204
00:21:46,620 --> 00:21:49,290
We got in some way though.

205
00:21:50,730 --> 00:21:52,380
May Allah make our end good.

206
00:21:52,720 --> 00:21:54,640
Amin, my Bey.

207
00:22:04,660 --> 00:22:06,640
You come uninvited.

208
00:22:06,870 --> 00:22:08,490
Are you raiding our property now?

209
00:22:08,520 --> 00:22:09,710
Shut up!

210
00:22:16,700 --> 00:22:18,240
Get outside.

211
00:22:31,620 --> 00:22:33,710
I left our calling halfway through.

212
00:22:36,340 --> 00:22:38,550
They killed our Alps.

213
00:22:40,620 --> 00:22:43,860
You are the only one who knew
the location of the headquarters.

214
00:22:49,340 --> 00:22:51,230
She left us in the middle of the road.

215
00:22:53,780 --> 00:22:55,180
I...

216
00:22:56,620 --> 00:22:58,490
Do I hold you
responsible for this?

217
00:22:58,710 --> 00:23:00,470
You told me this.

218
00:23:00,670 --> 00:23:02,590
Like you never know me.

219
00:23:03,020 --> 00:23:04,730
Even if our paths are the same.

220
00:23:05,010 --> 00:23:06,880
I don't want it to
ever cross, Osman Bey.

221
00:23:06,920 --> 00:23:08,570
Who is a slave to the Sultana...

222
00:23:10,260 --> 00:23:12,430
Our path and his path are not the same.

223
00:23:13,250 --> 00:23:15,070
You don't know what you're saying.

224
00:23:15,310 --> 00:23:17,080
Are you accusing me of treason now?

225
00:23:17,180 --> 00:23:18,590
You have completely
blinded your eyes.

226
00:23:18,600 --> 00:23:20,340
I'm not blind or anything like that.

227
00:23:25,600 --> 00:23:28,760
I know you won't tell of the
headquarters location.

228
00:23:31,410 --> 00:23:33,430
But you got so small that you fell back.

229
00:23:36,330 --> 00:23:39,190
They dared attack
because you weren't there.

230
00:23:39,430 --> 00:23:41,030
I was leaning on you.

231
00:23:41,380 --> 00:23:42,980
I considered you a mountain.

232
00:23:43,960 --> 00:23:47,930
But you're not even a hill.

233
00:23:50,880 --> 00:23:52,620
You hurt me the most.

234
00:23:54,690 --> 00:23:56,660
What about what you did to me?

235
00:23:57,660 --> 00:23:59,840
I am not a dull knife, Osman Bey.

236
00:24:00,560 --> 00:24:02,300
If you sharpen me that much...

237
00:24:02,640 --> 00:24:04,370
I definitely cut.

238
00:24:05,160 --> 00:24:10,110
You sharpened yourself and stood before me
for kingship...

239
00:24:10,800 --> 00:24:14,840
Let this be a lesson for me.

240
00:24:15,800 --> 00:24:17,450
Do you know what you did?

241
00:24:19,670 --> 00:24:24,310
You didn't want me.

242
00:24:25,380 --> 00:24:28,290
Do you know how many I lost when
I was walking behind you?

243
00:24:28,370 --> 00:24:29,980
How many wounds in my body?

244
00:24:30,040 --> 00:24:32,060
How many dear people have I lost?

245
00:24:37,720 --> 00:24:40,700
A few of those walking behind me
are alive.

246
00:24:40,780 --> 00:24:44,680
I buried my wife and the child in her womb
in the dirt, Osman Bey.

247
00:24:44,780 --> 00:24:47,760
And I buried my brothers and
comrades in the dirt.

248
00:24:50,030 --> 00:24:54,520
Have we given these losses to come back
from the middle of the road for a castle?

249
00:24:54,570 --> 00:24:55,600
The castle...

250
00:24:56,730 --> 00:25:01,040
If the calling does not reach
its goal, all losses are in vain.

251
00:25:01,220 --> 00:25:02,900
You still say castle.

252
00:25:04,120 --> 00:25:05,480
Castle, what?

253
00:25:05,850 --> 00:25:08,400
Don't you see, I am the ruler of Inegol.

254
00:25:10,490 --> 00:25:14,550
The matter is different.

255
00:25:31,140 --> 00:25:32,520
Osman.

256
00:25:33,050 --> 00:25:36,810
Walk now to see if you can walk
to Köpruhisar.

257
00:25:37,210 --> 00:25:38,240
Osman.

258
00:25:38,690 --> 00:25:41,110
This move of ours must
have made him mad, Olof.

259
00:25:41,860 --> 00:25:44,150
We broke Osman's feet.

260
00:25:44,760 --> 00:25:46,110
Soon...

261
00:25:47,490 --> 00:25:49,970
I will break his neck very soon.

262
00:25:50,560 --> 00:25:52,800
What İsmiha Sultan wanted happened.

263
00:25:53,760 --> 00:25:55,450
I think she is pleased.

264
00:25:55,650 --> 00:25:56,480
What about us?

265
00:26:01,100 --> 00:26:03,280
Will what we want happen?

266
00:26:04,300 --> 00:26:06,340
Marmaracık has become ours.

267
00:26:12,560 --> 00:26:14,620
My brother Frode is right.

268
00:26:15,340 --> 00:26:19,210
What if İsmihan Sultan doesn't give
Marmaracık to us?

269
00:26:20,050 --> 00:26:21,250
Olof.

270
00:26:26,950 --> 00:26:30,340
İsmihan Sultan wants to meet you.

271
00:26:36,630 --> 00:26:38,550
Yes, it's different.

272
00:26:40,280 --> 00:26:41,820
Different.

273
00:26:44,580 --> 00:26:45,990
The matter is different.

274
00:26:49,030 --> 00:26:51,000
You want more.

275
00:26:52,270 --> 00:26:54,400
You don't be satisfied with what you have.

276
00:26:55,530 --> 00:26:58,230
Greed for possession
has blinded your heart.

277
00:26:58,880 --> 00:27:00,280
Look at you.

278
00:27:00,850 --> 00:27:02,750
Look at that vanity.

279
00:27:03,360 --> 00:27:05,770
You are the one who brought
me to this situation.

280
00:27:06,200 --> 00:27:09,160
Are you now complaining about
Turgut, whom you have made so?

281
00:27:09,310 --> 00:27:11,930
Have you forgotten the injustice
you committed, Osman Bey?

282
00:27:11,960 --> 00:27:13,920
I will give the castle to Öktem for sure.

283
00:27:15,510 --> 00:27:16,600
Surely.

284
00:27:18,210 --> 00:27:20,170
They are strangers.

285
00:27:21,240 --> 00:27:24,020
If I do not give them a
property, they will leave us.

286
00:27:24,780 --> 00:27:26,230
They withdraw and go.

287
00:27:29,350 --> 00:27:30,910
But you...

288
00:27:31,520 --> 00:27:33,560
You were my support.

289
00:27:35,240 --> 00:27:36,850
I thought you were different.

290
00:27:39,380 --> 00:27:40,690
But...

291
00:27:43,470 --> 00:27:44,820
for a property...

292
00:27:47,280 --> 00:27:50,320
I never knew you would switch sides.

293
00:27:50,650 --> 00:27:56,020
I have not changed sides for
money, nor for the property.

294
00:28:01,360 --> 00:28:02,440
Decide.

295
00:28:06,070 --> 00:28:07,690
Choose your side.

296
00:28:13,110 --> 00:28:14,910
I did not sell you.

297
00:28:17,930 --> 00:28:19,860
Now come out of my castle, Osman Bey.

298
00:28:23,780 --> 00:28:25,950
- Inegol
- Inegol!

299
00:28:30,750 --> 00:28:32,520
It's not yours anymore.

300
00:28:44,940 --> 00:28:46,750
This does not happen without blood.

301
00:28:47,980 --> 00:28:49,670
I am the one who always fought.

302
00:28:50,770 --> 00:28:52,410
I was always ahead.

303
00:28:53,090 --> 00:28:54,860
I am the one who faced sedition.

304
00:28:55,900 --> 00:28:56,780
But...

305
00:28:58,270 --> 00:29:02,860
But those behind me
have always been deceived by these tricks.

306
00:29:04,860 --> 00:29:06,420
I am the one who always fought.

307
00:29:08,680 --> 00:29:10,410
You will fight now too.

308
00:29:11,910 --> 00:29:13,250
Against me.

309
00:29:17,630 --> 00:29:21,100
I give you two days to
leave this place.

310
00:29:25,590 --> 00:29:27,190
We give our souls, of course.

311
00:29:29,870 --> 00:29:31,530
But if you want our home...

312
00:29:33,380 --> 00:29:34,710
We do not give it.

313
00:29:41,290 --> 00:29:42,950
Then I take both.

314
00:30:10,080 --> 00:30:11,940
There are horse tracks on both sides.

315
00:30:13,520 --> 00:30:14,490
Sisters.

316
00:30:15,230 --> 00:30:17,300
Open your eyes well.

317
00:30:17,670 --> 00:30:20,470
Don't leave a place
without looking, come on.

318
00:30:20,810 --> 00:30:23,350
We'll look everywhere, Ayşe Hatun.

319
00:30:24,360 --> 00:30:25,670
May your heart be at ease.

320
00:30:26,800 --> 00:30:28,650
We'll find a trace, we'll find it.

321
00:30:29,470 --> 00:30:34,020
No return to Yenişehir
until a trace is found.

322
00:30:59,510 --> 00:31:00,480
Where are you?

323
00:31:01,720 --> 00:31:02,480
My son.

324
00:31:04,020 --> 00:31:05,030
Where are you?

325
00:31:11,060 --> 00:31:12,310
What is this?

326
00:31:12,920 --> 00:31:13,820
Ülgen.

327
00:31:13,950 --> 00:31:16,960
This earring belongs to Alçiçek.

328
00:31:18,660 --> 00:31:20,090
If she came here...

329
00:31:21,520 --> 00:31:23,050
I'm completely confused.

330
00:31:23,330 --> 00:31:25,050
Did you understand any of this?

331
00:31:26,340 --> 00:31:27,750
I don't know, Ülgen.

332
00:31:28,730 --> 00:31:29,710
I don't know.

333
00:31:30,780 --> 00:31:32,090
The only thing I know...

334
00:31:33,920 --> 00:31:36,750
is that Alçiçek
caused harm to my son.

335
00:31:38,260 --> 00:31:39,190
She did.

336
00:31:40,690 --> 00:31:41,520
Ayşe Hatun.

337
00:31:43,520 --> 00:31:44,360
Say it.

338
00:31:44,710 --> 00:31:46,690
This is Aktemur's horse.

339
00:31:48,590 --> 00:31:50,730
Oh my Allah, save him.

340
00:31:58,730 --> 00:31:59,860
Aktemur.

341
00:32:01,860 --> 00:32:02,970
Aktemur.

342
00:32:05,630 --> 00:32:06,740
Search everywhere.

343
00:32:08,850 --> 00:32:09,960
Look everywhere.

344
00:32:10,680 --> 00:32:12,630
Find him.

345
00:32:13,210 --> 00:32:15,790
Ülgen, find my son.

346
00:32:16,510 --> 00:32:17,450
We wil find him.

347
00:32:28,350 --> 00:32:29,210
My daughter.

348
00:32:32,840 --> 00:32:34,090
Why are you so lost?

349
00:32:39,150 --> 00:32:40,980
Thinking of Aktemur again?

350
00:32:42,040 --> 00:32:42,740
No.

351
00:32:43,650 --> 00:32:46,340
Why would I think of the man
who left me behind and gon?

352
00:32:46,770 --> 00:32:48,180
I think about what I will do.

353
00:32:50,580 --> 00:32:51,450
Well done.

354
00:32:53,220 --> 00:32:55,030
You listen to your mother.

355
00:32:56,030 --> 00:32:59,650
That boy does not have
the courage to run away.

356
00:33:01,930 --> 00:33:03,760
His love was a lie, my daughter

357
00:33:14,510 --> 00:33:17,710
Listen to your mother
and don't worry about anything else, okay?

358
00:33:23,440 --> 00:33:25,260
I learned my lesson, mother.

359
00:33:26,180 --> 00:33:27,910
I will do what you say from now on.

360
00:33:34,430 --> 00:33:36,070
So, my opinion is...

361
00:33:36,500 --> 00:33:38,920
not to delay the wedding
and to have it at once.

362
00:34:00,540 --> 00:34:01,390
My Bey.

363
00:34:02,770 --> 00:34:03,720
What's the matter?

364
00:34:05,009 --> 00:34:06,400
Are you going to the court?

365
00:34:06,520 --> 00:34:07,410
Yes.

366
00:34:09,179 --> 00:34:10,920
We go to the court, however...

367
00:34:12,759 --> 00:34:15,119
I don't know how I will
look at Osman Bey's face.

368
00:34:16,290 --> 00:34:17,880
You did nothing wrong.

369
00:34:18,259 --> 00:34:21,040
A thousand people ask for a girl
and one person takes her.

370
00:34:21,969 --> 00:34:24,820
There is no reason for resentment
and indignation in this.

371
00:34:25,440 --> 00:34:26,569
Yes but...

372
00:34:29,319 --> 00:34:33,130
it wasn't good to reject Osman Bey.

373
00:34:33,509 --> 00:34:34,839
What should we do?

374
00:34:35,259 --> 00:34:39,610
Why would we listen to the words of
Osman Bey in the presence of İsmihan Sultan?

375
00:34:40,540 --> 00:34:42,029
You did the right thing.

376
00:34:42,920 --> 00:34:45,889
It is İsmihan Sultan
who stands behind you anymore.

377
00:34:50,739 --> 00:34:53,110
Alçiçek,
is she okay?

378
00:34:54,389 --> 00:34:56,090
Is she satisfied?

379
00:34:57,110 --> 00:34:58,550
I spoke to her.

380
00:34:59,830 --> 00:35:02,040
She has consent to marry Bayındır.

381
00:35:06,950 --> 00:35:07,680
Good.

382
00:35:09,030 --> 00:35:10,110
Aybars.

383
00:35:11,960 --> 00:35:13,660
Let's go and not be late.

384
00:35:23,840 --> 00:35:25,730
Söğüt

385
00:36:37,070 --> 00:36:38,670
You will wait, Beys.

386
00:36:39,160 --> 00:36:40,670
Why will we wait?

387
00:36:41,180 --> 00:36:43,080
Are we no longer
welcomed in the court?

388
00:36:43,360 --> 00:36:45,760
Alps, what is the reason for that?

389
00:36:46,920 --> 00:36:49,680
This is what Osman Bey wants.

390
00:36:50,590 --> 00:36:52,330
If anyone is burdened by this...

391
00:36:52,990 --> 00:36:56,880
Alps will accompany him to Yenişehir gate.

392
00:37:20,560 --> 00:37:21,850
Salam Alaikum.

393
00:37:22,380 --> 00:37:23,550
Alaikum Salam.

394
00:37:24,880 --> 00:37:25,820
Beys.

395
00:37:27,180 --> 00:37:28,830
Our meeting has become a court.

396
00:37:30,570 --> 00:37:32,750
There must be a price for this, too.

397
00:37:34,220 --> 00:37:35,510
And the price of this...

398
00:37:36,840 --> 00:37:38,490
is to reduce our number.

399
00:37:42,360 --> 00:37:44,760
Our path is more difficult than before.

400
00:37:45,390 --> 00:37:47,170
But the conquests will continue.

401
00:37:48,010 --> 00:37:50,430
We will continue to march
towards the enemy.

402
00:37:51,050 --> 00:37:53,570
We will never bow our
necks to the oppressors.

403
00:37:54,490 --> 00:37:58,690
But if someone wants to cross the
threshold of the court...

404
00:38:01,100 --> 00:38:04,320
Let him consider that the noose
will be wrapped around his neck.

405
00:38:04,770 --> 00:38:10,200
No one will try to cross the threshold of the court
without fearing for his head.

406
00:38:10,560 --> 00:38:11,810
This is my last warning.

407
00:38:12,570 --> 00:38:15,310
This is the last chance for
those who wish to return.

408
00:38:17,200 --> 00:38:19,390
Those who want to go
will not be asked why.

409
00:38:20,680 --> 00:38:22,280
But if someone wants to come...

410
00:38:22,770 --> 00:38:24,700
Our door is always open.

411
00:38:28,510 --> 00:38:31,450
He who does not risk death
does not walk this path.

412
00:38:32,130 --> 00:38:33,160
Come on, Beys.

413
00:38:42,950 --> 00:38:46,300
Osman Bey granted permission,
so why do you stand before us?

414
00:38:46,440 --> 00:38:47,190
So?

415
00:38:47,840 --> 00:38:49,190
He...

416
00:38:49,280 --> 00:38:50,120
Yes.

417
00:38:50,430 --> 00:38:55,620
He said those who give up are
not Bey or Alp anymore.

418
00:38:55,920 --> 00:39:02,620
Whoever isn't an Alp or a Bey
had no right to carry a sword either.

419
00:39:03,130 --> 00:39:04,180
He says.

420
00:39:15,490 --> 00:39:18,030
If only I had smashed them with the mace.

421
00:39:28,710 --> 00:39:29,780
Go ahead.

422
00:39:39,100 --> 00:39:45,780
In the ninety-nine names of Allah, who
made us responsible for the conquest...

423
00:39:46,360 --> 00:39:47,720
I open the court.

424
00:39:48,130 --> 00:39:50,050
In the name of of Allah the Merciful.

425
00:39:50,250 --> 00:39:52,480
In the name of of Allah the Merciful.

426
00:39:54,480 --> 00:39:58,590
You must have heard what
happened to our headquarters.

427
00:39:59,140 --> 00:40:01,160
We heard the bad news, Osman Bey.

428
00:40:01,270 --> 00:40:03,310
But the thing you
should have heard was not this.

429
00:40:04,540 --> 00:40:07,490
What you had to hear was only
the good news of the conquest.

430
00:40:12,820 --> 00:40:13,670
My Bey.

431
00:40:14,340 --> 00:40:16,350
You keep your conquests a secret.

432
00:40:19,070 --> 00:40:21,230
Who revealed the secret
of the headquarters?

433
00:40:26,390 --> 00:40:28,800
I will cut off his head when I find out.

434
00:40:31,240 --> 00:40:32,650
Who attacked?

435
00:40:35,350 --> 00:40:36,730
It was Olof who attacked.

436
00:40:41,650 --> 00:40:47,600
There is no attack or betrayal that
holds the force that can stop us.

437
00:40:49,330 --> 00:40:51,270
The court was assembled
for this reason.

438
00:40:51,580 --> 00:40:55,000
We will fix everything
as soon as possible.

439
00:40:55,020 --> 00:40:57,180
We are ready to do
whatever it takes, my Bey.

440
00:40:57,960 --> 00:41:00,740
Whether we will sacrifice blood or soul...

441
00:41:02,210 --> 00:41:03,630
Thank you.

442
00:41:04,930 --> 00:41:05,730
Osman Bey.

443
00:41:06,390 --> 00:41:09,420
What does İsmihan Sultan
say about this situation?

444
00:41:25,590 --> 00:41:27,700
You would have given me land, my Sultan.

445
00:41:31,740 --> 00:41:35,630
When did your ancestors
come to Constantinople?

446
00:41:38,640 --> 00:41:39,700
Two centuries ago?

447
00:41:45,160 --> 00:41:46,420
Three centuries?

448
00:41:49,900 --> 00:41:53,960
What makes you think
you can take the land from me...

449
00:41:55,050 --> 00:41:59,640
which Rome, despite your services all
these years, did not give you so easily?

450
00:42:00,680 --> 00:42:01,900
This is not the issue.

451
00:42:03,070 --> 00:42:04,460
I did what you said.

452
00:42:05,010 --> 00:42:06,840
Now it's your turn, Sultan.

453
00:42:09,490 --> 00:42:13,790
You will give me
Marmaracık Castle.

454
00:42:14,230 --> 00:42:15,150
Right now!

455
00:42:20,930 --> 00:42:22,030
Sir Olof.

456
00:42:23,330 --> 00:42:25,190
You are so excited to die.

457
00:42:39,510 --> 00:42:41,170
I will keep my promise.

458
00:42:43,170 --> 00:42:46,960
And you will never forget who I am...

459
00:42:47,300 --> 00:42:49,200
Commander Olof.

460
00:42:52,630 --> 00:42:53,510
Do not you dare.

461
00:42:56,240 --> 00:42:58,270
If I give you the land now..

462
00:42:59,360 --> 00:43:01,520
Osman will take it back from
you immediately.

463
00:43:01,870 --> 00:43:03,910
Let him try.

464
00:43:04,740 --> 00:43:06,990
And I will crush him under those walls.

465
00:43:07,410 --> 00:43:08,990
You won't do what you want...

466
00:43:10,210 --> 00:43:12,450
you will do what I want.

467
00:43:14,800 --> 00:43:17,890
First, you will kill Osman.

468
00:43:25,940 --> 00:43:30,390
When Osman receives the news, he will
go out to look for his nephew Aktemur.

469
00:43:31,680 --> 00:43:35,280
And you will drag him
into the biggest trap.

470
00:43:37,680 --> 00:43:38,850
Death trap.

471
00:43:39,950 --> 00:43:41,280
Don't worry, my Sultan.

472
00:43:42,870 --> 00:43:44,640
I prepared my plan a long time ago.

473
00:43:52,470 --> 00:43:54,670
My Sultan, Turgut Bey is coming.

474
00:44:23,200 --> 00:44:28,390
Who wonders about the opinion of
İsmihan Sultan should go with her.

475
00:44:33,270 --> 00:44:35,670
Why did you enter the
threshold, Şahin Bey?

476
00:44:36,960 --> 00:44:39,870
I ask to understand the
situation we will be in.

477
00:44:40,800 --> 00:44:45,420
If you have any doubts, the noose is
on my neck, Osman Bey.

478
00:44:50,850 --> 00:44:52,720
Thank you.

479
00:44:54,370 --> 00:44:55,570
Otherwise...

480
00:45:00,670 --> 00:45:04,400
What is said in the court
remains inside it.

481
00:45:15,700 --> 00:45:18,150
The issue of opening Köprühisar
has been revealed.

482
00:45:18,420 --> 00:45:20,400
All equipment has been destroyed.

483
00:45:22,130 --> 00:45:23,410
But..

484
00:45:25,760 --> 00:45:28,510
Now is the time to conquest.

485
00:45:30,230 --> 00:45:33,710
They wouldn't expect us to
be ready in such a short time.

486
00:45:34,560 --> 00:45:36,600
Despite their knowledge
of Köprühisar...

487
00:45:37,280 --> 00:45:40,670
They will not even imagine that
we will march towards Köpruhisar.

488
00:45:42,670 --> 00:45:44,800
- Alps.
- Sir.

489
00:45:45,200 --> 00:45:47,950
You will cut down trees even
in the middle of the night.

490
00:45:48,400 --> 00:45:52,870
You will continue to make
catapults by the light of torches.

491
00:45:53,860 --> 00:45:55,600
Alps will be ready in no time.

492
00:45:56,050 --> 00:45:59,970
Blacksmiths will continue to make swords.

493
00:46:01,010 --> 00:46:03,230
You will finish preparations for war.

494
00:46:04,030 --> 00:46:06,100
They cut our beard.

495
00:46:06,500 --> 00:46:08,850
We will cut off their heads.

496
00:46:10,470 --> 00:46:12,740
Inshallah, as soon as possible, my Bey

497
00:46:14,050 --> 00:46:15,360
The court is over.

498
00:46:16,270 --> 00:46:18,030
Get ready quickly.

499
00:46:19,490 --> 00:46:23,030
The swords you will bring
are the keys to conquest.

500
00:46:35,540 --> 00:46:37,060
Osman Bey.

501
00:46:39,060 --> 00:46:40,290
Aktemur.

502
00:46:41,180 --> 00:46:43,650
- What happened to Aktemur?
- He's not here, my Bey.

503
00:46:43,680 --> 00:46:46,950
My Bey, he went to
run away with Alçiçek.

504
00:46:47,300 --> 00:46:48,450
And he didn't come back.

505
00:46:48,790 --> 00:46:50,390
I went to the meeting place.

506
00:46:50,720 --> 00:46:53,760
His horse was there, but he was not there.

507
00:46:54,470 --> 00:46:55,760
Osman Bey.

508
00:46:57,200 --> 00:46:58,590
My son is not there.

509
00:46:59,140 --> 00:47:00,910
What do you say, Ayşe Hatun?

510
00:47:02,450 --> 00:47:05,200
Why are you doing this
without telling me?

511
00:47:10,640 --> 00:47:14,710
Boran, send Cerkutay to the place mentioned
by Ayşe Hatun as soon as possible.

512
00:47:15,230 --> 00:47:17,120
He should begin
searching for a trace.

513
00:47:17,600 --> 00:47:21,530
Alps will get ready, we have another goal.

514
00:47:22,350 --> 00:47:23,830
Your command, my Bey.

515
00:47:36,790 --> 00:47:38,610
Hadrat Mother Sultan.

516
00:47:42,260 --> 00:47:47,630
Mother Sultan, then let me begin
the wedding preparations at once.

517
00:47:48,150 --> 00:47:49,470
Start.

518
00:47:50,210 --> 00:47:53,750
Start so you can hit the road.

519
00:47:54,450 --> 00:47:57,200
Walk to your destination, Bayındır.

520
00:47:57,570 --> 00:47:59,200
Your command, Sultan Mother.

521
00:48:10,210 --> 00:48:12,230
Yes, Turgut Bey?

522
00:48:13,300 --> 00:48:16,320
What brings you here without news?

523
00:48:18,050 --> 00:48:21,840
Whoever I said my brother
did not choose the truth.

524
00:48:23,730 --> 00:48:26,590
On the contrary, he wants
to rule İnegöl himself.

525
00:48:27,150 --> 00:48:29,230
I am here, Turgut Bey.

526
00:48:30,270 --> 00:48:33,830
There is no judgment for Osman
in the place where I am.

527
00:48:37,010 --> 00:48:41,510
Does he want me to take
all his possessions with one decision?

528
00:48:41,990 --> 00:48:44,110
What does Osman Bey want?

529
00:48:46,110 --> 00:48:47,280
Arrogance.

530
00:48:48,610 --> 00:48:52,350
Too bad, you are right.

531
00:48:53,460 --> 00:48:55,810
Arrogance has blinded Osman Bey's eyes.

532
00:48:56,790 --> 00:49:00,660
All he wants is for this reason.

533
00:49:01,170 --> 00:49:02,660
He made us behind him.

534
00:49:03,840 --> 00:49:05,600
And put you in front of him.

535
00:49:06,800 --> 00:49:08,610
He made many conquests.

536
00:49:09,540 --> 00:49:13,040
And now he wants to rule unjustly.

537
00:49:15,190 --> 00:49:18,070
Didn't you shed blood for
İnegöl, Turgut Bey?

538
00:49:18,420 --> 00:49:19,440
I did.

539
00:49:20,420 --> 00:49:25,910
You risked antagonizing us.

540
00:49:27,200 --> 00:49:29,870
Osman fought injustice.

541
00:49:30,720 --> 00:49:32,910
And now he has become one
of the oppressors.

542
00:49:36,710 --> 00:49:38,160
While I'm here...

543
00:49:39,360 --> 00:49:43,120
Injustice is forbidden, Turgut Bey.

544
00:49:58,990 --> 00:50:00,950
If you choose my side...

545
00:50:01,810 --> 00:50:06,100
Then I will give you soldiers and
swords as many as you want.

546
00:50:08,630 --> 00:50:13,710
And you will always feel the presence
of the Mother Sultan behind you.

547
00:50:14,910 --> 00:50:17,320
When you said this earlier, I
didn't believe you.

548
00:50:18,850 --> 00:50:20,820
But I saw this
with my own eyes.

549
00:50:28,470 --> 00:50:31,030
There is no place for the
unfaithful by my side.

550
00:50:37,090 --> 00:50:43,920
I am on your side now, Mother Sultan.

551
00:51:30,830 --> 00:51:35,810
While Othman thinks he is coming to you,
he will fall into my hands.

552
00:51:42,550 --> 00:51:44,640
It will be your turn too.

553
00:51:45,190 --> 00:51:48,670
But first I will kill your uncle.

554
00:51:49,190 --> 00:51:51,470
And when I take what I want...

555
00:51:52,830 --> 00:51:54,960
I will dedicate his blood to Odin.

556
00:51:55,250 --> 00:51:58,050
You will not reach your goal, dogs.

557
00:52:19,230 --> 00:52:21,700
Did you throw the bait?

558
00:52:22,880 --> 00:52:25,140
First they will be confused...

559
00:52:25,890 --> 00:52:29,980
We made it difficult for them to find the
traces so that they would not be suspicious.

560
00:52:30,240 --> 00:52:33,660
But all traces will bring
them to the same place.

561
00:52:34,530 --> 00:52:36,600
This place will be Osman's grave.

562
00:52:40,090 --> 00:52:44,850
We will fight today as if
it is our last day.

563
00:52:45,330 --> 00:52:48,930
And we will eliminate Osman
and those with him.

564
00:52:51,760 --> 00:52:54,370
- Take care of him.
- Don't worry.

565
00:52:55,720 --> 00:52:58,420
I will treat him very well.

566
00:53:00,500 --> 00:53:04,870
Sharpen your axes and
let Odin be your helper.

567
00:53:05,240 --> 00:53:07,160
let's go.

568
00:53:28,020 --> 00:53:29,710
It's very beautiful, Marta.

569
00:53:31,070 --> 00:53:33,760
Send me a roll of all these fabrics.

570
00:53:34,180 --> 00:53:35,840
Absolutely, Bengi Hatun

571
00:53:36,460 --> 00:53:40,940
Looking at the fabrics you have chosen,
you understand fabrics very well.

572
00:53:43,760 --> 00:53:48,020
Bengi Hatun knows how to
choose the most beautiful in everything.

573
00:53:53,730 --> 00:53:58,640
If you do wrong to her, you
will do wrong to us.

574
00:53:58,910 --> 00:54:01,900
Give her the most beautiful
in everything she chose.

575
00:54:04,010 --> 00:54:06,120
Welcome, Bayındır Bey.

576
00:54:06,900 --> 00:54:08,110
Certainly.

577
00:54:09,330 --> 00:54:12,700
Happily we met,
Bayıdır Bey, I have been looking for you.

578
00:54:13,290 --> 00:54:15,020
We must not
delay the wedding.

579
00:54:16,460 --> 00:54:19,620
Nice to say, Bengi Hatun.

580
00:54:20,850 --> 00:54:23,620
I was next to the Mother Sultan.

581
00:54:25,700 --> 00:54:28,050
We propose to have the
wedding tomorrow.

582
00:54:33,950 --> 00:54:37,800
Especially if we have the opportunity and
all obstacles have been removed...

583
00:54:39,070 --> 00:54:41,160
We must not delay it.

584
00:54:41,820 --> 00:54:46,140
I will speak to Öktem Bey
and you will begin to prepare.

585
00:54:46,890 --> 00:54:48,840
- Hüseyin.
- Your command, my Bey.

586
00:54:49,630 --> 00:54:51,710
Send heralds everywhere.

587
00:54:52,170 --> 00:54:55,460
- We have a wedding tomorrow.
- Your command, my Bey.

588
00:54:59,810 --> 00:55:03,740
While you're talking
about obstacles, I don't see anyone.

589
00:55:04,330 --> 00:55:05,770
What did you do to Aktemur?

590
00:55:12,130 --> 00:55:16,000
I didn't do anything, however...

591
00:55:16,760 --> 00:55:23,430
Apparently, someone had cleared around
before I could do anything about it.

592
00:55:24,030 --> 00:55:27,260
So I didn't get my hands dirty in vain.

593
00:55:27,520 --> 00:55:31,010
What I say? Allah loves this servant.

594
00:55:34,340 --> 00:55:39,310
I will pay whatever Bengi Hatun chooses.

595
00:55:39,340 --> 00:55:40,450
No need.

596
00:55:41,170 --> 00:55:43,410
We solve our own problems.

597
00:55:44,150 --> 00:55:48,780
Do what you must do, son-in-law.

598
00:56:48,810 --> 00:56:50,710
What are you doing like that?

599
00:56:52,990 --> 00:56:56,660
What do you smell?
Did you think it would smell like food?

600
00:56:58,040 --> 00:57:01,160
Every trace has its own scent, Gürbüz.

601
00:57:02,430 --> 00:57:04,550
Some traces are not seen.

602
00:57:05,730 --> 00:57:08,730
Does this make sense?
Are you kidding me?

603
00:57:14,690 --> 00:57:18,190
Osman Bey made me
take this lunatic next to me.

604
00:57:18,560 --> 00:57:21,320
- There are people coming.
- There are people coming.

605
00:57:30,380 --> 00:57:33,630
This means that you have
other skills besides eating.

606
00:57:34,070 --> 00:57:37,200
Oh, if only you knew my skills...

607
00:57:40,620 --> 00:57:42,990
- Salam Alaikum.
- Alaikum Salam.

608
00:57:43,300 --> 00:57:46,960
Cerkutay Alp, those
traces don't lead to anywhere.

609
00:57:55,580 --> 00:57:58,100
This means that we are on the right track.

610
00:57:59,110 --> 00:58:01,960
All traces point to Sofular.

611
00:58:02,900 --> 00:58:05,760
Continue on this path.

612
00:58:14,380 --> 00:58:16,610
I will go and tell my Bey.

613
00:58:18,080 --> 00:58:19,660
Give me my apple!

614
00:58:21,910 --> 00:58:24,290
Come here and give me this apple!

615
00:58:24,430 --> 00:58:27,230
I will burn you.. I will burn you!

616
00:58:28,020 --> 00:58:31,290
Come on, Brother Gürbüz.

617
00:58:36,990 --> 00:58:38,740
Anyway, I will find you.

618
00:58:41,820 --> 00:58:45,590
Konur, one of Osman Bey's
Alps, wants to see you

619
00:58:48,470 --> 00:58:49,940
Let him come.

620
00:59:10,420 --> 00:59:16,060
What is the reason
you came here, Osman's Alp?

621
00:59:17,830 --> 00:59:21,770
It is waking up from the sleep of
heedlessness after all these years, my Sultan.

622
00:59:23,300 --> 00:59:27,940
I am not Osman's Alp, I was one of the
skilled leaders of the Seljuk family.

623
00:59:28,860 --> 00:59:30,370
Now?

624
00:59:30,500 --> 00:59:34,430
And now I am a man who
has been completely fired.

625
00:59:37,280 --> 00:59:39,440
We don't accept everyone who gets fired.

626
00:59:39,700 --> 00:59:41,710
Who asked you to accept me, my Sultan?

627
00:59:42,380 --> 00:59:46,770
I have come here to apologize from
my country and then find what I deserve.

628
00:59:49,860 --> 00:59:52,530
What treatment does he deserve, Avcı Bey?

629
00:59:52,650 --> 00:59:55,900
Foot whipping forty times and
take everything he owned.

630
00:59:55,950 --> 00:59:57,300
This is a mistake.

631
00:59:58,730 --> 01:00:03,330
I have gone after a Bey
and have betrayed my position.

632
01:00:05,040 --> 01:00:07,100
What I deserve is execution.

633
01:00:10,200 --> 01:00:15,370
So, you came here to be killed

634
01:00:16,090 --> 01:00:18,560
- Are you?
- Yes.

635
01:00:37,820 --> 01:00:43,390
A person pays the price for his
betrayal only with his soul.

636
01:00:54,540 --> 01:00:59,970
But you will pay it with our service.

637
01:01:00,400 --> 01:01:02,320
I will do whatever you want, my Sultan.

638
01:01:02,730 --> 01:01:04,630
Of course you will.

639
01:01:05,580 --> 01:01:07,320
What is my mission?

640
01:01:24,560 --> 01:01:29,820
They will think that they have demolished
and burned us, but we will not stumble.

641
01:01:30,520 --> 01:01:32,400
The conquests will continue.

642
01:01:34,250 --> 01:01:41,190
Whenever the call of Allah rises in our
hearts, we'll make the whole world rise up.

643
01:01:42,800 --> 01:01:44,530
We will not despair.

644
01:01:49,410 --> 01:01:51,970
Our goal is clear.

645
01:01:59,720 --> 01:02:01,880
Our target is Köprühisar.

646
01:02:06,100 --> 01:02:11,480
My Bey, our current residence is
very close to Marmaracık.

647
01:02:13,220 --> 01:02:15,110
Is this out of caution?

648
01:02:15,540 --> 01:02:18,880
This place will facilitate our conquests.

649
01:02:19,480 --> 01:02:24,060
It is hidden and obvious at the same time.

650
01:02:24,630 --> 01:02:29,100
My Bey, shall we send news to Oktem Bey,
since we are so close to Marmaragic?

651
01:02:30,020 --> 01:02:33,990
Let us complete the headquarters,
then we will see.

652
01:02:34,140 --> 01:02:35,140
Eyvallah my Bey.

653
01:02:35,310 --> 01:02:37,650
And he will make his preparations.

654
01:02:38,070 --> 01:02:39,800
We said what we have in the court.

655
01:02:40,320 --> 01:02:43,080
We have nothing to hide from anyone.

656
01:02:43,320 --> 01:02:47,180
And when the catapults are ready, we
will strike harder than ever.

657
01:02:47,180 --> 01:02:48,780
Inshallah my Bey.

658
01:02:49,100 --> 01:02:50,640
Inshallah my Bey.

659
01:02:51,020 --> 01:02:52,060
My Bey.

660
01:02:52,060 --> 01:02:54,060
And what about Aktemur?

661
01:02:55,820 --> 01:02:56,960
Aktemur.

662
01:02:57,320 --> 01:02:58,200
My Bey.

663
01:02:59,180 --> 01:03:00,200
Cerkutay.

664
01:03:02,920 --> 01:03:04,680
We've found Aktemur Bey's trail.

665
01:03:04,680 --> 01:03:06,680
They are keeping him in Sofular.

666
01:03:06,680 --> 01:03:07,520
Are you sure?

667
01:03:07,520 --> 01:03:09,520
Traces are complicated, my Bey.

668
01:03:09,520 --> 01:03:11,520
However, they all refer to
the location of the Sofular.

669
01:03:15,580 --> 01:03:16,700
Alps.

670
01:03:18,420 --> 01:03:19,780
Get ready

671
01:03:20,440 --> 01:03:22,420
We'll go get Aktemur.

672
01:04:01,580 --> 01:04:03,680
My son couldn't have a joyful life.

673
01:04:04,820 --> 01:04:05,900
Oh my Lord.

674
01:04:06,780 --> 01:04:09,200
Lord protect my son.

675
01:04:11,600 --> 01:04:12,540
My Ayse.

676
01:04:13,320 --> 01:04:16,000
You will see your son, Inshallah.

677
01:04:16,440 --> 01:04:17,540
Don't do this.

678
01:04:18,380 --> 01:04:19,280
Right.

679
01:04:19,860 --> 01:04:22,740
Osman Bey won't let those ignobles
keep Aktemur!

680
01:04:22,740 --> 01:04:24,740
Of course they will come.

681
01:04:25,300 --> 01:04:26,740
They will come.

682
01:04:31,800 --> 01:04:32,880
Thank you.

683
01:04:38,180 --> 01:04:40,880
Everyone shall know!

684
01:04:40,880 --> 01:04:43,900
Tomorrow evening
in Marmaragic Castle...

685
01:04:44,040 --> 01:04:48,780
Bayindir Bey and Oktem Bey's daughter
Alcicek's wedding will be held.

686
01:04:48,780 --> 01:04:50,780
The whole Yenisehir is invited.

687
01:04:54,120 --> 01:04:55,640
Don't do it, Alcicek!

688
01:04:56,120 --> 01:04:58,920
That girl burned my son!

689
01:04:59,340 --> 01:05:02,400
We do not know where my son is,
and these are holding a wedding!

690
01:05:02,520 --> 01:05:04,160
Calm down, my dear Ayse.

691
01:05:19,400 --> 01:05:21,360
You're all here, Hatuns.

692
01:05:23,080 --> 01:05:25,200
I have come for good news.

693
01:05:26,440 --> 01:05:27,620
But obviously..

694
01:05:31,240 --> 01:05:32,500
...you have received the news.

695
01:05:32,500 --> 01:05:34,060
We know it, Bengi Hatun.

696
01:05:34,500 --> 01:05:36,840
Enjoy it.

697
01:05:37,920 --> 01:05:41,500
I hope you don't regret your decision
as a mother.

698
01:05:44,080 --> 01:05:46,300
I hope not, if Allah permits.

699
01:05:47,000 --> 01:05:49,020
But I don't see anything I might regret.

700
01:05:56,880 --> 01:06:00,760
Or are you upset that we
did not give you Alcicek?

701
01:06:00,860 --> 01:06:01,920
Bengi Hatun.

702
01:06:02,500 --> 01:06:04,340
Say what you're going to say quickly.

703
01:06:04,800 --> 01:06:07,020
And don't keep us busy.

704
01:06:08,580 --> 01:06:10,460
You're upset,
I get it.

705
01:06:10,460 --> 01:06:12,460
Don't, Hatuns.

706
01:06:13,600 --> 01:06:17,880
Is it a sin that Alcicek is beautiful and
her lovers are many?

707
01:06:23,880 --> 01:06:27,000
1000 men desire a girl
but only one gets to marry her.

708
01:06:29,800 --> 01:06:32,220
Isn't this right, Ayse Hatun?

709
01:06:36,860 --> 01:06:38,500
Aktemur is not around.

710
01:06:39,560 --> 01:06:41,740
Or is he ashamed to be seen?

711
01:06:45,160 --> 01:06:48,180
Aktemur is a Subasi, Bengi Hatun.

712
01:06:49,300 --> 01:06:51,940
He doesn't have time.

713
01:06:51,940 --> 01:06:53,940
He's at duty.

714
01:06:54,490 --> 01:06:56,570
Don't worry about my son.

715
01:06:56,580 --> 01:06:58,580
He'll forget soon.

716
01:06:59,960 --> 01:07:01,180
Of course he will forget.

717
01:07:03,540 --> 01:07:05,100
He has to.

718
01:07:11,180 --> 01:07:12,020
Whatever.

719
01:07:13,720 --> 01:07:16,160
Send my greetings to Osman Bey.

720
01:07:18,380 --> 01:07:20,480
We are all waiting for you at our wedding.

721
01:07:27,520 --> 01:07:28,640
Ayse!

722
01:07:31,060 --> 01:07:33,320
Ayse, calm down please.

723
01:07:35,420 --> 01:07:37,660
She is playing with us!

724
01:07:39,120 --> 01:07:41,880
Once I find my son...

725
01:07:42,460 --> 01:07:44,200
Then I know what to do with you.

726
01:07:44,920 --> 01:07:46,200
Wait for me.

727
01:07:50,000 --> 01:07:51,160
I am holding back.

728
01:07:51,580 --> 01:07:53,800
I can barely hold myself back.

729
01:07:54,020 --> 01:07:55,800
But when that day comes....

730
01:07:56,860 --> 01:07:58,860
...do not try to stop me.

731
01:07:59,700 --> 01:08:00,860
Never try to stop me.

732
01:08:45,120 --> 01:08:48,279
My Bey, there are soldiers
on duty on each side

733
01:08:49,319 --> 01:08:51,359
And there are many of them indeed, my Bey.

734
01:08:51,840 --> 01:08:55,020
We will water our swords with
the blood of infidels

735
01:08:57,379 --> 01:08:58,760
We've found them.

736
01:08:59,919 --> 01:09:02,459
And now we will chop off their heads.

737
01:09:03,640 --> 01:09:06,760
Allah is the greatest!
Allah is the greatest!

738
01:09:06,760 --> 01:09:08,760
Attack them,
kill them all!

739
01:10:44,140 --> 01:10:46,240
Come here.

740
01:10:46,240 --> 01:10:48,000
You're searching your nephew, right?

741
01:10:48,000 --> 01:10:49,700
I will get what I want.

742
01:10:49,700 --> 01:10:51,700
The only thing you will get today...

743
01:10:52,960 --> 01:10:54,800
...is the corpse of Aktemur.

744
01:10:55,620 --> 01:10:57,260
You won't see him today.

745
01:10:57,280 --> 01:10:58,720
I'll get both Aktemur...

746
01:10:58,720 --> 01:11:00,720
...and your soul!

747
01:11:01,150 --> 01:11:02,480
Attack!

748
01:11:02,500 --> 01:11:05,400
Come to me.
Come!

749
01:13:14,110 --> 01:13:15,400
Cerkutay.

750
01:13:59,210 --> 01:14:00,230
Baysungur.

751
01:14:16,520 --> 01:14:17,590
Osman!

752
01:14:19,780 --> 01:14:21,250
I came to kill you!

753
01:14:22,520 --> 01:14:25,190
I came to avenge my alps!

754
01:14:25,620 --> 01:14:28,920
I will kill you along with them!

755
01:14:29,760 --> 01:14:30,860
Come on then!

756
01:14:31,420 --> 01:14:32,500
Come!

757
01:15:01,760 --> 01:15:02,890
Orhan

758
01:15:05,730 --> 01:15:07,010
Praise be!

759
01:15:07,900 --> 01:15:09,860
- Oh right!
- Oh right!

760
01:15:19,070 --> 01:15:20,600
Oh right!

761
01:15:23,110 --> 01:15:24,280
Oh right!

762
01:15:24,900 --> 01:15:26,250
Praise be!

763
01:15:29,170 --> 01:15:30,520
Oh right!

764
01:15:33,030 --> 01:15:34,570
- Oh Allah!
- Oh Allah!

765
01:15:38,220 --> 01:15:40,060
- Oh right!
- Oh right!

766
01:15:47,350 --> 01:15:48,400
Avci Bey.

767
01:15:49,400 --> 01:15:51,080
What about testing Konur?

768
01:15:54,190 --> 01:15:56,070
Then we can give him the duty.

769
01:16:30,030 --> 01:16:31,150
Show us what you have.

770
01:16:45,730 --> 01:16:46,780
You are skilled

771
01:16:49,280 --> 01:16:50,910
As Avci Bey...

772
01:16:51,770 --> 01:16:55,080
...you will be my bodyguard
and my assistant too.

773
01:16:58,500 --> 01:16:59,560
Now go.

774
01:17:18,250 --> 01:17:19,790
Can we trust him, my Sultan?

775
01:17:20,350 --> 01:17:23,630
I carry out campaigns that
will destroy Osman.

776
01:17:25,930 --> 01:17:27,300
He is getting destroyed.

777
01:17:28,050 --> 01:17:29,140
The destroyed...

778
01:17:29,850 --> 01:17:32,950
...knows that aid is here.
I am the saviour.

779
01:17:34,440 --> 01:17:36,690
Turgut and Konur...

780
01:17:37,360 --> 01:17:39,530
They are only the beginning, Avcı Bey.

781
01:17:40,030 --> 01:17:42,460
This position you assigned him
is too close.

782
01:17:43,400 --> 01:17:45,380
I keep the people I trust close to me.

783
01:17:46,810 --> 01:17:50,330
I keep the people I don't trust
even closer.

784
01:17:53,570 --> 01:17:55,080
Don't take your eyes off Konor.

785
01:17:56,050 --> 01:18:00,180
Until we're sure he is one of us.

786
01:18:00,380 --> 01:18:01,870
Your command, my sultan.

787
01:18:13,050 --> 01:18:14,060
Olof!

788
01:18:14,280 --> 01:18:15,630
We will not succeed!

789
01:18:16,640 --> 01:18:17,780
Pull back!

790
01:18:25,860 --> 01:18:27,420
- Oh Allah!
- Oh Allah!

791
01:18:31,000 --> 01:18:32,080
My Allah.

792
01:18:32,650 --> 01:18:34,360
Today I killed one of you.

793
01:18:35,240 --> 01:18:36,990
Tomorrow I will kill all of you!

794
01:18:37,790 --> 01:18:39,440
Praise be upon you my valiants!

795
01:18:39,710 --> 01:18:40,760
Praise be!

796
01:18:48,960 --> 01:18:49,990
Sons

797
01:18:51,680 --> 01:18:52,860
Come here.

798
01:18:56,730 --> 01:18:57,750
Praise be!

799
01:18:58,260 --> 01:18:59,600
Praise be to you!

800
01:19:00,290 --> 01:19:02,370
Your hearts are as strong as your arms!

801
01:19:03,170 --> 01:19:05,120
As long as you are united like this...

802
01:19:05,770 --> 01:19:07,850
...no one can oppress us,
if Allah permits.

803
01:19:08,430 --> 01:19:10,290
- Eyvallah my Bey.
- Eyvallah my Bey.

804
01:19:11,790 --> 01:19:13,990
Boran, my brother!

805
01:19:14,620 --> 01:19:17,340
Nothing will hurt you!
Nothing!

806
01:19:18,640 --> 01:19:19,930
Will this wound hurt you?

807
01:19:20,280 --> 01:19:22,000
Are you okay brother?
Oh brother?

808
01:19:23,470 --> 01:19:25,500
My Bey! Boran!

809
01:19:26,910 --> 01:19:28,070
Brother!

810
01:19:33,310 --> 01:19:34,360
My Bey is coming.

811
01:19:34,830 --> 01:19:37,020
My Bey is coming,
you are alright brother

812
01:19:37,150 --> 01:19:38,190
You are fine.

813
01:19:43,180 --> 01:19:44,220
Boran.

814
01:19:45,520 --> 01:19:46,550
Brother.

815
01:19:46,900 --> 01:19:47,940
My Bey!

816
01:19:49,300 --> 01:19:50,330
Hang on.

817
01:19:51,180 --> 01:19:52,430
I'm fine, I am fine.

818
01:19:53,040 --> 01:19:54,110
Hang on.

819
01:19:54,470 --> 01:19:56,250
Come on, get ready quickly!

820
01:19:56,760 --> 01:19:57,910
We will go to Yenisehir!

821
01:19:58,850 --> 01:20:00,720
Come on, let's go brothers!

822
01:20:00,970 --> 01:20:02,300
Let's go,
you're all right, Boran!

823
01:20:02,610 --> 01:20:03,730
Come on brothers!

824
01:20:13,810 --> 01:20:15,230
What a shame.

825
01:20:17,530 --> 01:20:21,020
I wish the girl who stabbed you with
the dagger could see you right now.

826
01:20:22,390 --> 01:20:23,420
What was her name?

827
01:20:27,460 --> 01:20:28,670
Alcicek.

828
01:20:30,030 --> 01:20:31,050
She is a beautiful girl.

829
01:20:31,250 --> 01:20:32,850
Don't ever say her name!

830
01:20:39,120 --> 01:20:41,850
Alcicek.

831
01:20:58,740 --> 01:21:00,370
Osman Bey has ruined their game.

832
01:21:07,050 --> 01:21:08,150
What happened, Olof?

833
01:21:15,290 --> 01:21:16,750
What happened, Olof?
What happened?

834
01:21:17,070 --> 01:21:18,330
He did not die!

835
01:21:26,550 --> 01:21:28,310
Osman Bey dealt with you.

836
01:21:33,900 --> 01:21:34,940
But wait.

837
01:21:37,450 --> 01:21:39,150
You will live the worst.

838
01:21:40,620 --> 01:21:41,660
Wait for it.

839
01:21:42,370 --> 01:21:44,380
Do not rush your death.

840
01:21:45,440 --> 01:21:47,260
Your turn will come.

841
01:21:51,550 --> 01:21:52,950
I swear...

842
01:21:53,650 --> 01:21:55,560
I swear to Odin!

843
01:21:56,930 --> 01:21:59,190
I will not die before
I drink Osman's blood.

844
01:22:09,520 --> 01:22:11,030
So they couldn't hit him?

845
01:22:11,660 --> 01:22:13,390
Where are they taking the goods now?

846
01:22:13,610 --> 01:22:16,000
To Karaken Forest behind the castle.

847
01:22:17,000 --> 01:22:18,620
They say it'll be safe there.

848
01:22:19,660 --> 01:22:20,670
Good

849
01:22:21,430 --> 01:22:22,540
They should guard well.

850
01:22:23,020 --> 01:22:25,080
Go and check the place,
check if it's safe.

851
01:22:25,550 --> 01:22:26,810
As you command my Bey.

852
01:22:35,870 --> 01:22:37,490
What are they taking, Avci Bey.

853
01:22:39,000 --> 01:22:41,620
What is your business
with the goods we trade?

854
01:22:41,790 --> 01:22:43,390
Nothing, just curiosity.

855
01:22:43,890 --> 01:22:46,130
I want to be on the
lookout and do my job.

856
01:22:46,450 --> 01:22:48,310
If you want to do your job...

857
01:22:48,470 --> 01:22:50,700
...don't put your nose in everything, Konur.

858
01:22:52,800 --> 01:22:54,600
Let's inspect the soldiers.

859
01:22:55,260 --> 01:22:56,300
Eyvallah.

860
01:23:01,100 --> 01:23:03,850
Yenisehir

861
01:23:03,850 --> 01:23:04,950
We have arrived, brother!

862
01:23:04,950 --> 01:23:07,150
Hang on, hang on.

863
01:23:07,150 --> 01:23:09,150
Lie him down here.

864
01:23:09,150 --> 01:23:11,450
We arrived.

865
01:23:11,450 --> 01:23:14,800
Hang on, hang on, hang on, hang on Boran!

866
01:23:14,800 --> 01:23:15,550
Hang on!

867
01:23:17,100 --> 01:23:18,320
Hang on!

868
01:23:21,720 --> 01:23:23,620
Kumral Abdal!

869
01:23:23,900 --> 01:23:24,720
My Bey!

870
01:23:25,200 --> 01:23:26,270
My Bey!

871
01:23:27,920 --> 01:23:31,320
Kumral Abdal, Kumral Abdal!
Come!

872
01:23:31,320 --> 01:23:32,870
He lost so much blood.

873
01:23:32,870 --> 01:23:36,200
Bring water and clean cloths!
Now!

874
01:23:36,450 --> 01:23:37,570
Come on!

875
01:23:37,650 --> 01:23:38,500
My Bey.

876
01:23:40,520 --> 01:23:41,850
His wound seems deep.

877
01:23:41,850 --> 01:23:43,850
My Boran!

878
01:23:44,450 --> 01:23:45,800
My brother!

879
01:23:48,500 --> 01:23:51,420
Press here hard, press here hard!

880
01:23:52,750 --> 01:23:57,570
Boran, brother open your eyes!
Boran is fading away my Bey!

881
01:23:58,120 --> 01:24:00,350
Boran is fading away my Bey!

882
01:24:00,350 --> 01:24:02,350
Cerkutay!

883
01:24:02,900 --> 01:24:04,350
Come to your senses!

884
01:24:04,500 --> 01:24:06,050
Come to your senses!

885
01:24:06,050 --> 01:24:08,050
I can bear no more pain, my Bey!

886
01:24:08,950 --> 01:24:11,200
I can't stand another pain, my Bey!

887
01:24:11,400 --> 01:24:13,100
Nothing will happen!

888
01:24:13,720 --> 01:24:14,670
Do not worry.

889
01:24:18,970 --> 01:24:20,250
Boran is strong.

890
01:24:21,050 --> 01:24:22,970
Nothing will happen to him.

891
01:24:24,170 --> 01:24:25,970
He will open his eyes.

892
01:24:25,970 --> 01:24:27,970
He will!

893
01:24:30,100 --> 01:24:31,820
Boran get up!

894
01:24:34,750 --> 01:24:36,800
- Cerkutay.
- My Bey!

895
01:24:47,150 --> 01:24:48,470
Boran.

896
01:24:56,920 --> 01:25:02,720
How do you spread the news of the
wedding without consulting me?

897
01:25:02,720 --> 01:25:04,720
Talk, Bayindir!

898
01:25:05,250 --> 01:25:06,670
Bengi!

899
01:25:06,670 --> 01:25:08,670
Calm down.

900
01:25:08,870 --> 01:25:10,520
We also see that it is early.

901
01:25:10,520 --> 01:25:14,620
But Ismihan Sultan forced us to do so.

902
01:25:15,000 --> 01:25:16,400
She acted, I...

903
01:25:16,400 --> 01:25:18,400
I don't care about that, Bayindir!

904
01:25:19,370 --> 01:25:21,350
You did not consult me!

905
01:25:23,670 --> 01:25:25,870
Why are we rushing?

906
01:25:25,970 --> 01:25:27,870
You have just asked for my daughter...

907
01:25:28,170 --> 01:25:30,900
...and today you want to
hold the wedding as soon as possible!

908
01:25:32,050 --> 01:25:37,550
My Bey, Ismihan Sultan says
that good deeds should not be postponed.

909
01:25:39,200 --> 01:25:41,570
You are accusing Bayindir Bey wrongly.

910
01:25:45,150 --> 01:25:48,150
How can he oppose the order of Sultan?

911
01:25:50,650 --> 01:25:54,400
What is the difference between
today and tomorrow?

912
01:25:55,420 --> 01:25:58,270
- They are not different, however...
- I know what you mean.

913
01:25:58,970 --> 01:26:05,170
You want to put it off because your
daughter is getting married and moving out

914
01:26:05,170 --> 01:26:07,600
This upsets me too.

915
01:26:09,050 --> 01:26:11,720
I am her parent just like you.

916
01:26:20,070 --> 01:26:21,700
How are the preparations?

917
01:26:22,550 --> 01:26:24,650
Don't forget anything.

918
01:26:25,870 --> 01:26:28,850
We have to send news to Osman Bey
but I am ashamed to do so!

919
01:26:29,400 --> 01:26:31,250
How are we going to do that, Bayindir?

920
01:26:31,250 --> 01:26:33,570
I invited them today.

921
01:26:34,000 --> 01:26:35,520
But I don't know if they will come.

922
01:26:35,700 --> 01:26:37,650
We did what we had to do.

923
01:26:37,920 --> 01:26:39,350
It's not on us anymore.

924
01:26:39,900 --> 01:26:42,850
Let Osman Bey figure out the rest.

925
01:26:43,500 --> 01:26:44,670
Okay.

926
01:26:53,250 --> 01:26:55,000
Why does Bengi Hatun talk like that?

927
01:26:55,000 --> 01:26:57,100
I don't understand the reason
for this rush.

928
01:26:57,100 --> 01:26:58,770
My mom is afraid that
I will back down.

929
01:26:59,370 --> 01:27:00,970
That's why she hurries.

930
01:27:00,970 --> 01:27:03,270
Are you really going to marry
Bayindir Bey?

931
01:27:06,950 --> 01:27:08,200
I will marry him.

932
01:27:08,200 --> 01:27:10,200
You don't love that man.

933
01:27:10,200 --> 01:27:13,120
Why would you do this to yourself,
Alcicek Hatun?

934
01:27:13,420 --> 01:27:15,100
What should I do, Esma?

935
01:27:15,100 --> 01:27:18,120
Should I wait for the coward Aktemur
who abandoned me?

936
01:27:18,120 --> 01:27:19,650
What if he didn't abandon you?

937
01:27:19,650 --> 01:27:21,650
No one in the market saw him.

938
01:27:21,650 --> 01:27:23,650
He vanished like a breeze.

939
01:27:25,370 --> 01:27:27,570
He is probably ashamed to show up.

940
01:27:28,570 --> 01:27:30,780
He must be wondering
how to look me in the eye.

941
01:27:31,320 --> 01:27:34,550
Let this wedding happen,
then you'll see him around!

942
01:27:45,550 --> 01:27:48,720
Komral Abdal, he has no energy.

943
01:27:49,970 --> 01:27:51,420
He lost so much blood.

944
01:27:54,300 --> 01:27:57,350
He will liven up once he drinks
the healing sherbet.

945
01:27:59,320 --> 01:28:01,450
Our brother Boran is fighting for his life.

946
01:28:01,850 --> 01:28:05,560
Turgut Bey went on one side and
Konur Alp on the other!

947
01:28:05,560 --> 01:28:07,820
We are falling apart one by one, brothers.

948
01:28:12,920 --> 01:28:14,770
Konur Alp is coming.

949
01:28:33,750 --> 01:28:35,420
What are you doing here?

950
01:28:36,070 --> 01:28:37,420
Is Boran okay?

951
01:28:38,100 --> 01:28:42,100
What's your business with him? Didn't you
turn your back on your brothers?

952
01:28:42,450 --> 01:28:44,650
Didn't you obey Ismihan Sultan?

953
01:28:47,300 --> 01:28:49,170
Let me see my brother.

954
01:28:49,170 --> 01:28:51,170
You can't see anyone.

955
01:28:51,400 --> 01:28:53,170
If you have something to say...

956
01:28:54,420 --> 01:28:56,120
...talk to Osman Bey.

957
01:29:00,570 --> 01:29:01,850
Come on.

958
01:29:11,750 --> 01:29:13,620
Preparations will continue.

959
01:29:14,400 --> 01:29:20,220
The conquests will not stop
even if we have losses or ghazis.

960
01:29:20,220 --> 01:29:23,620
It's not like we have just set off, my Bey.

961
01:29:23,620 --> 01:29:25,620
We were born on this path.

962
01:29:26,820 --> 01:29:28,820
I would sacrifice a thousand sons.

963
01:29:29,150 --> 01:29:32,320
But I am sure that we will take my son
back, Insallah.

964
01:29:36,170 --> 01:29:38,300
And Boran will be fine, Inshallah, my Bey.

965
01:29:39,850 --> 01:29:41,570
Inshallah, he will get over this

966
01:29:42,670 --> 01:29:44,170
He is my friend.

967
01:29:45,250 --> 01:29:46,670
And a confidant.

968
01:29:47,470 --> 01:29:49,170
We have overcome many
hardships together.

969
01:29:50,850 --> 01:29:53,810
And there are still so many paths
that we will walk together

970
01:29:54,770 --> 01:29:58,320
My Bey, what about Ismihan Hatun?

971
01:29:59,420 --> 01:30:01,070
What is her role in this matter?

972
01:30:02,100 --> 01:30:05,020
After hearing about her opposite
thoughts about the war...

973
01:30:05,045 --> 01:30:07,235
...sisters stopped joining the sister union.

974
01:30:08,050 --> 01:30:09,870
Her aim was to leave us alone.

975
01:30:10,950 --> 01:30:12,200
Turgut.

976
01:30:12,650 --> 01:30:13,770
Bayindir.

977
01:30:15,420 --> 01:30:17,270
This is just the beginning.

978
01:30:18,170 --> 01:30:20,560
Konur Alp was seen with Ismihan Sultan
as well.

979
01:30:22,470 --> 01:30:24,250
Why didn't you count him, father?

980
01:30:31,970 --> 01:30:34,500
Can I come in my Bey?

981
01:30:35,250 --> 01:30:36,900
Come.

982
01:31:03,750 --> 01:31:04,850
My Bey.

983
01:31:06,070 --> 01:31:08,100
I don't know how he dared to come but...

984
01:31:09,470 --> 01:31:11,900
...we took him to you.

985
01:31:23,650 --> 01:31:25,450
Speak.

986
01:31:26,070 --> 01:31:28,500
I heard where
they're holding Aktemur, my Bey.

987
01:31:42,470 --> 01:31:43,970
Eyvallah.

988
01:31:45,200 --> 01:31:48,700
We will continue to beat
them with our games

989
01:31:49,070 --> 01:31:50,700
But we will be careful.

990
01:31:51,200 --> 01:31:55,300
We will not back down from
this universal cause of ours!

991
01:32:04,400 --> 01:32:06,120
Come!

992
01:32:17,420 --> 01:32:18,770
Now get out of my sight!

993
01:32:20,570 --> 01:32:23,920
You hit me at the first mistake
and abandon me!

994
01:32:25,350 --> 01:32:28,280
- Turns out Turgut Bey was right.
- I told you to get out!

995
01:32:50,050 --> 01:32:53,200
Ismihan Sultan must be willing to have you
object me.

996
01:32:53,850 --> 01:32:55,200
Go and obey her.

997
01:32:55,420 --> 01:32:57,320
Become her man.

998
01:32:57,470 --> 01:32:59,580
You are going to learn
everything you need.

999
01:33:28,000 --> 01:33:30,300
We know where Aktemur is.

1000
01:33:36,000 --> 01:33:39,000
Thank Allah.

1001
01:33:44,320 --> 01:33:46,270
But your task is not over.

1002
01:33:49,970 --> 01:33:51,950
Give it to me.

1003
01:33:59,620 --> 01:34:01,900
And you go back
to your duty, to Sogut.

1004
01:34:02,220 --> 01:34:03,620
Your command, my Bey.

1005
01:34:04,750 --> 01:34:07,100
You have to earn Ismihan Hatun's trust.

1006
01:34:07,600 --> 01:34:11,400
You have to learn
her every move beforehand.

1007
01:34:12,150 --> 01:34:16,320
My Bey, I'd like to see my brother
before I leave, if you'll excuse me

1008
01:34:17,170 --> 01:34:21,370
Our brothers didn't let me
as they didn't know about the game.

1009
01:34:28,150 --> 01:34:29,650
Can we come, my Bey?

1010
01:34:30,220 --> 01:34:31,750
Come.

1011
01:34:36,670 --> 01:34:38,050
Peace be upon you.

1012
01:34:38,700 --> 01:34:40,050
And may peace be upon you.

1013
01:34:41,520 --> 01:34:44,170
- Brother
- My Konur!

1014
01:34:54,370 --> 01:34:55,050
Boran.

1015
01:34:55,050 --> 01:34:55,870
My Bey!

1016
01:34:56,850 --> 01:35:00,300
We will take revenge on those who made
this to you and to Aktemur.

1017
01:35:01,070 --> 01:35:02,250
Inshallah my Bey.

1018
01:35:19,800 --> 01:35:21,270
Brother.

1019
01:35:22,100 --> 01:35:23,900
Forgive me.

1020
01:35:24,300 --> 01:35:27,120
You acted so well that I couldn't
really see the truth!

1021
01:35:33,400 --> 01:35:34,800
I forgive you, brother.

1022
01:35:36,700 --> 01:35:39,250
Thank Allah for this day, brothers!

1023
01:35:39,670 --> 01:35:42,220
May Allah make us stay
in this blessed path.

1024
01:35:45,020 --> 01:35:46,520
We got hungry huh!

1025
01:35:46,520 --> 01:35:50,570
You didn't eat anything
to take care of Boran, huh!

1026
01:35:50,570 --> 01:35:52,570
Do you see my brother Boran?

1027
01:35:52,570 --> 01:35:54,870
Cerkutay loves you more than he loves food

1028
01:35:55,620 --> 01:35:57,050
Right brother.

1029
01:35:58,170 --> 01:36:00,450
Look at my dear brother!

1030
01:36:04,420 --> 01:36:09,200
Cerkutay, you're going to make me cry.

1031
01:36:13,750 --> 01:36:15,120
Where is Gurbuz Alp?

1032
01:36:18,750 --> 01:36:20,100
Dear brothers

1033
01:36:21,950 --> 01:36:23,600
Where is Gurbuz Alp?

1034
01:36:25,870 --> 01:36:28,970
Not here, the food is gone, brothers!

1035
01:36:28,970 --> 01:36:30,670
The food is gone, brothers!

1036
01:36:30,670 --> 01:36:33,900
The food is gone!

1037
01:36:35,100 --> 01:36:37,220
Come on brother, come on!

1038
01:36:57,050 --> 01:36:59,220
Stop it, Gurbuz Alp, don't!

1039
01:36:59,550 --> 01:37:00,620
Don't!

1040
01:37:02,520 --> 01:37:05,500
The rest is mine, okay?

1041
01:37:06,870 --> 01:37:07,920
Gorbuz Alp!

1042
01:37:08,320 --> 01:37:10,520
I'm about to starve.

1043
01:37:10,520 --> 01:37:13,100
And Ulgen Hatun
doesn't even give me food.

1044
01:37:14,620 --> 01:37:15,870
Let me eat it.

1045
01:37:16,700 --> 01:37:23,120
Now put it on the ground slowly.

1046
01:37:26,070 --> 01:37:32,470
Brother, you know that I love bulgur
with meat very much!

1047
01:37:32,470 --> 01:37:37,170
Stop Stop!
Stop, stop, stop, stop!

1048
01:37:38,150 --> 01:37:41,450
Yes, I know!

1049
01:37:41,450 --> 01:37:43,450
Is that Cerkutay!

1050
01:37:44,020 --> 01:37:45,120
What is he saying?

1051
01:37:46,370 --> 01:37:47,950
I know that.

1052
01:37:48,870 --> 01:37:50,400
I know you love!

1053
01:37:52,000 --> 01:37:56,320
But actually, I am the one who loves!

1054
01:37:56,950 --> 01:37:58,320
Does he talk to himself?

1055
01:37:59,550 --> 01:38:01,220
I love!

1056
01:38:01,820 --> 01:38:03,570
I miss!

1057
01:38:07,490 --> 01:38:09,520
I want it back!

1058
01:38:19,110 --> 01:38:20,410
Is he talking about me?

1059
01:38:21,300 --> 01:38:22,640
Oh!

1060
01:38:23,120 --> 01:38:24,230
I...

1061
01:38:24,800 --> 01:38:26,110
Honestly?

1062
01:38:26,570 --> 01:38:28,360
Has my luck reversed?

1063
01:38:28,490 --> 01:38:31,360
Is Cerkutay in love with me?

1064
01:38:32,370 --> 01:38:33,550
Surely!

1065
01:38:34,460 --> 01:38:37,450
He must be getting prepared
before talking to me!

1066
01:38:38,540 --> 01:38:39,680
Allah!

1067
01:38:47,350 --> 01:38:48,580
Eh!

1068
01:38:50,390 --> 01:38:52,470
If I don't eat I will be angry!

1069
01:38:52,720 --> 01:38:54,990
I get defeated by my anger!

1070
01:38:56,580 --> 01:38:58,350
This is hardly enough for me!

1071
01:38:58,790 --> 01:39:00,240
Go away!

1072
01:39:00,430 --> 01:39:03,730
You finished it!
Finished!

1073
01:39:03,940 --> 01:39:05,840
Look at me, brother!

1074
01:39:06,970 --> 01:39:08,880
If you don't give it to me...

1075
01:39:09,020 --> 01:39:10,910
...I too will be defeated by my anger.

1076
01:39:11,670 --> 01:39:15,890
You took the apple from me in the morning,
do you remember?

1077
01:39:15,890 --> 01:39:16,860
Yes?

1078
01:39:17,060 --> 01:39:20,460
Now bring me an apple.

1079
01:39:20,930 --> 01:39:22,700
Then I'll share my food.

1080
01:39:23,180 --> 01:39:25,750
- Oh really?
- Apple.

1081
01:39:27,040 --> 01:39:30,930
An apple he wants!
Of course.

1082
01:39:31,100 --> 01:39:32,820
Don't move.

1083
01:39:38,760 --> 01:39:40,100
Don't move.

1084
01:39:43,920 --> 01:39:45,940
Apple!

1085
01:39:47,120 --> 01:39:49,740
Juicy apples here!

1086
01:39:49,740 --> 01:39:52,260
The apple, the apple!

1087
01:40:07,300 --> 01:40:10,210
You will pay Gurbuz Alp!

1088
01:40:12,620 --> 01:40:15,040
Allah reversed my luck!

1089
01:40:15,740 --> 01:40:17,780
He did!

1090
01:40:18,410 --> 01:40:20,370
Is this a dream?

1091
01:40:23,250 --> 01:40:25,670
We will have a double wedding!

1092
01:40:25,860 --> 01:40:29,120
Double wedding with Alcicek and

1093
01:40:29,380 --> 01:40:30,620
We can't do that

1094
01:40:32,550 --> 01:40:35,140
Where are you Aktemur Bey?

1095
01:40:35,700 --> 01:40:38,670
They will give your sweetheart to a
stranger, where are you?

1096
01:41:05,940 --> 01:41:07,210
My Sheik

1097
01:41:11,610 --> 01:41:15,220
The problems in my heart
have also filled your heart.

1098
01:41:20,090 --> 01:41:22,000
Have you come to heal me?

1099
01:41:26,140 --> 01:41:29,400
Welcome, welcome, my sheikh.

1100
01:41:34,470 --> 01:41:36,730
- Here.
- Eyvallah.

1101
01:41:40,620 --> 01:41:42,920
In the name of of Allah the Merciful,
the Compassionate.

1102
01:41:52,850 --> 01:41:54,960
You are afraid, Osman Bey.

1103
01:41:55,750 --> 01:41:58,450
I know, you're afraid.

1104
01:41:59,910 --> 01:42:02,480
I want to walk in the path of Hadrat Abraham

1105
01:42:04,590 --> 01:42:10,460
I want to destroy all those idols
with my own hands, my sheikh.

1106
01:42:11,120 --> 01:42:12,490
However...

1107
01:42:12,540 --> 01:42:19,570
However, today's idols are neither seen
with eyes nor held by the hand.

1108
01:42:19,690 --> 01:42:20,930
Right, Osman Bey?

1109
01:42:26,130 --> 01:42:29,060
Even my companion
fell into their trap!

1110
01:42:30,770 --> 01:42:32,050
He brags!

1111
01:42:33,140 --> 01:42:36,020
If he wins, he considers himself
the owner of that victory.

1112
01:42:38,030 --> 01:42:42,470
And now I'm afraid of not being able to
destroy those idols, my sheikh.

1113
01:42:44,720 --> 01:42:46,890
If this fear is in your heart...

1114
01:42:47,090 --> 01:42:48,850
...you should be happy, Osman Bey.

1115
01:42:49,450 --> 01:42:53,200
Because you can't win without it.

1116
01:42:54,460 --> 01:42:56,560
The moment you are victorious...

1117
01:42:57,010 --> 01:43:00,070
...is the moment when
you are exposed to the biggest test.

1118
01:43:03,710 --> 01:43:05,470
Think about it.

1119
01:43:07,580 --> 01:43:10,590
The first foray after the conquest of Mecca.

1120
01:43:12,800 --> 01:43:14,840
The Muslims won again, my sheikh.

1121
01:43:15,960 --> 01:43:19,510
But they were about to be defeated.

1122
01:43:20,370 --> 01:43:25,390
The Messenger of Allah,
when he conquered Mecca...

1123
01:43:26,270 --> 01:43:29,710
All victories of his
were nearly wasted.

1124
01:43:30,970 --> 01:43:37,130
Hunayn is a battle in which the army of the
Messenger of Allah was numerous.

1125
01:43:37,300 --> 01:43:43,020
They also armed themselves with
the best weapons.

1126
01:43:44,160 --> 01:43:46,580
They looked very strong.

1127
01:43:47,200 --> 01:43:49,930
But some who were among them...

1128
01:43:50,190 --> 01:43:54,270
...declared victory even before they fight.

1129
01:43:55,450 --> 01:43:59,780
They said then: "Who can beat us?"

1130
01:44:00,530 --> 01:44:03,990
Allah mentioned this in his book.

1131
01:44:06,340 --> 01:44:12,790
God Almighty said after the end of the
battle in Surat Al-Tawbah:

1132
01:44:13,880 --> 01:44:16,150
"In the name of of Allah the Merciful,
the Compassionate."

1133
01:44:16,250 --> 01:44:17,860
"In the name of of Allah the Merciful,
the Compassionate."

1134
01:44:18,740 --> 01:44:24,060
"Indeed Allah has given you ˹believers˺
victory on many battlefields...

1135
01:44:24,620 --> 01:44:27,850
...even at the Battle of Ḥunain...

1136
01:44:28,250 --> 01:44:38,800
...when you took pride in your great numbers,
but they proved of no advantage to you.

1137
01:44:40,010 --> 01:44:46,830
The earth, despite its vastness, seemed to
close in on you...

1138
01:44:47,060 --> 01:44:50,460
...then you turned back in retreat."

1139
01:44:50,700 --> 01:44:52,260
What about me?

1140
01:44:54,960 --> 01:44:56,430
What should I do, my sheikh?

1141
01:44:56,890 --> 01:44:59,060
Fear the punishment of Allah.

1142
01:44:59,840 --> 01:45:03,900
Do not lose your hope
about His mercy, Osman Bey.

1143
01:45:04,820 --> 01:45:07,620
The son of Adam is very forgetful.

1144
01:45:09,070 --> 01:45:13,190
You and your amry shall not forget...

1145
01:45:13,870 --> 01:45:17,900
The few have triumphed over the many
many times.

1146
01:45:19,140 --> 01:45:22,380
Remember the Battle of Badr, in which the
Muslims were few in number.

1147
01:45:23,090 --> 01:45:27,380
Remember the Battle of Hunayn, in which
Muslims outnumbered the enemy, Osman Bey.

1148
01:45:28,380 --> 01:45:29,730
Osman Bey.

1149
01:45:30,540 --> 01:45:32,080
Do not forget.

1150
01:45:33,050 --> 01:45:38,090
Who won the Battle of Badr
is the faith of the believers...

1151
01:45:38,320 --> 01:45:41,180
....and their obedience
to Allah Almighty.

1152
01:45:41,690 --> 01:45:45,270
As for Huneyn, despite all that power...

1153
01:45:45,750 --> 01:45:49,570
...because of a moment of inattention
and a moment of arrogance...

1154
01:45:50,030 --> 01:45:52,250
...they were about to be defeated.

1155
01:45:53,320 --> 01:45:56,060
And now we are going
through the same exam.

1156
01:45:57,870 --> 01:45:59,790
We are being tested with our selfs,
my sheik.

1157
01:45:59,980 --> 01:46:02,680
Humans are there to be tested, Osman Bey.

1158
01:46:02,860 --> 01:46:04,250
That's for sure.

1159
01:46:05,160 --> 01:46:09,870
Know that whenever Muslims
hold on to the rope of Allah...

1160
01:46:10,220 --> 01:46:13,280
...they will always win.

1161
01:46:14,090 --> 01:46:18,920
The ones who obey their desires
will suffer.

1162
01:46:21,950 --> 01:46:23,100
It is true what you say, Sheikh.

1163
01:46:33,800 --> 01:46:36,880
Osman Bey, without looking for the truth...

1164
01:46:38,010 --> 01:46:41,050
...considers us responsible
for the attack on the headquarters.

1165
01:46:42,040 --> 01:46:43,180
Moreover...

1166
01:46:43,710 --> 01:46:47,960
He asks for Ingol,
where we gave many martyrs.

1167
01:46:52,320 --> 01:46:54,050
But I will not give it to him.

1168
01:46:55,080 --> 01:46:57,550
I won't give him the only land I rule!

1169
01:47:00,030 --> 01:47:01,370
What shall we do, my Bey?

1170
01:47:01,890 --> 01:47:04,170
Will raise our swords to our brothers?

1171
01:47:05,290 --> 01:47:07,210
We will do what we have to do.

1172
01:47:07,660 --> 01:47:10,780
Whoever wants to leave can leave now!
There is the door!

1173
01:47:12,070 --> 01:47:15,030
You show leavers the door.

1174
01:47:15,910 --> 01:47:19,150
What will you show to the one
who is entering, Turgut Bey?

1175
01:47:20,040 --> 01:47:21,700
Your anger?

1176
01:47:35,910 --> 01:47:36,990
Kumral Abdal.

1177
01:47:37,160 --> 01:47:38,410
No.

1178
01:47:39,770 --> 01:47:41,280
Sit down, Turgut Bey.

1179
01:47:46,220 --> 01:47:49,190
All these conflicts happened
because you wanted to sit there.

1180
01:47:50,930 --> 01:47:54,300
So sit down now.

1181
01:47:55,160 --> 01:47:57,060
If you get up, you'll hurt me.

1182
01:47:59,890 --> 01:48:01,580
Your reproach proves that...

1183
01:48:02,130 --> 01:48:04,810
What hurts you is me going after
what's my right!

1184
01:48:06,720 --> 01:48:08,870
I still want to answer your question.

1185
01:48:09,740 --> 01:48:13,820
All these fights and conflicts
are not because of my love of the throne!

1186
01:48:14,260 --> 01:48:16,990
Rather, because of the injustice
of Osman Bey.

1187
01:48:16,990 --> 01:48:19,650
I did not come here to gossip about
Osman Bey, Turgut...

1188
01:48:22,320 --> 01:48:23,320
...Bey.

1189
01:48:27,990 --> 01:48:30,000
When the dress of love is taken off...

1190
01:48:30,500 --> 01:48:33,470
...a man is covered in selfishness.

1191
01:48:34,530 --> 01:48:37,350
I can never find the
dress of selfishness to fit you

1192
01:48:41,820 --> 01:48:43,380
You are on the wrong side.

1193
01:48:43,640 --> 01:48:45,010
I came to say this.

1194
01:48:45,420 --> 01:48:49,370
My Kumral Abdal is mistaken!

1195
01:48:49,500 --> 01:48:52,860
Neither money nor position
is more important than my case!

1196
01:48:52,860 --> 01:48:55,670
I entered this path in order to
spread the name of Allah Almighty!

1197
01:48:55,670 --> 01:48:57,350
I will always walk this way!

1198
01:48:57,350 --> 01:49:01,370
Is this why you divided the community
because of a position issue, Turgut?

1199
01:49:01,370 --> 01:49:05,060
The property I have acquired is the mark
of my case!

1200
01:49:05,130 --> 01:49:06,570
And it's halal, and you know that!

1201
01:49:06,570 --> 01:49:08,040
Why would I be ashamed?

1202
01:49:29,440 --> 01:49:33,450
Your tongue and your heart
doens't talk the same way, Turgut.

1203
01:49:35,900 --> 01:49:38,030
If you go to war like this.

1204
01:49:39,550 --> 01:49:45,750
If an arrow hits you.

1205
01:49:47,440 --> 01:49:49,190
You will die, Turgut.

1206
01:49:52,650 --> 01:49:55,420
The Turgut I knew before
wouldn't die!

1207
01:49:56,770 --> 01:49:59,020
Because lovers do not die!

1208
01:50:00,750 --> 01:50:03,010
But you die, Turgut!

1209
01:50:03,850 --> 01:50:05,230
You are oblivious.

1210
01:50:08,790 --> 01:50:10,760
Wake up from the sleep of inattention!

1211
01:50:11,800 --> 01:50:13,480
Wear the clothes of love!

1212
01:50:15,840 --> 01:50:17,610
The oblivious die!

1213
01:50:17,700 --> 01:50:20,300
Lovers never die, Turgut!

1214
01:50:36,500 --> 01:50:39,250
Yenisehir

1215
01:50:51,610 --> 01:50:52,610
Alps!

1216
01:50:52,900 --> 01:50:54,650
Come on, get ready, we're going out!

1217
01:50:54,650 --> 01:50:56,140
My Bey, my Bey.

1218
01:50:57,510 --> 01:50:59,860
Allow us, my Bey, let us come too.

1219
01:51:00,700 --> 01:51:04,450
It's hard to sit here with
my hands crossed

1220
01:51:06,770 --> 01:51:09,260
Ayse Hatun, don't blame me.

1221
01:51:09,540 --> 01:51:11,620
We did this without your knowledge.

1222
01:51:11,860 --> 01:51:15,470
But Aktemur, my nephew,
is entrusted to me.

1223
01:51:16,260 --> 01:51:19,550
I'll take him and bring back to you
safe and sound. Don't worry.

1224
01:51:19,680 --> 01:51:20,600
Insha'Allah.

1225
01:51:20,890 --> 01:51:22,270
May Allah make your path easy.

1226
01:51:22,900 --> 01:51:23,830
Eyvallah.

1227
01:51:24,190 --> 01:51:25,220
Alps!

1228
01:51:25,750 --> 01:51:26,840
Ride!

1229
01:52:04,970 --> 01:52:11,010
You will continue to distribute them to
merchants, Beys and everyone, Avci Bey.

1230
01:52:13,380 --> 01:52:17,350
Let people know where the gold
is coming from.

1231
01:52:17,650 --> 01:52:22,590
And let the merchants know
with whom they will trade.

1232
01:52:23,520 --> 01:52:25,990
Do your job well, Avci.

1233
01:52:26,470 --> 01:52:28,680
Give gold to whomever wants gold.

1234
01:52:29,050 --> 01:52:31,320
Give horses to whomever wants a horse.

1235
01:52:31,520 --> 01:52:34,900
Give sword to whomever wants a sword.

1236
01:52:40,990 --> 01:52:47,120
After your order, the incoming immigrants
have been placed in near tribes, my Sultan.

1237
01:52:47,380 --> 01:52:52,190
The seeds of hypocrisy were spread among
the beys of Karacahisar.

1238
01:52:55,560 --> 01:52:56,830
Nice.

1239
01:52:59,000 --> 01:53:01,100
This will help us a lot later.

1240
01:53:03,620 --> 01:53:05,340
Has the news reached Olof?

1241
01:53:05,400 --> 01:53:06,830
Yes my Sultan.

1242
01:53:07,530 --> 01:53:12,090
Aktemur's head will fall on Yenisehir
like a fire.

1243
01:53:44,080 --> 01:53:48,610
Didn't your uncle, your Osman Bey
come to rescue you?

1244
01:53:52,310 --> 01:53:54,860
You have been captured because of love.

1245
01:53:55,940 --> 01:53:57,980
And he let you govern the city.

1246
01:54:00,140 --> 01:54:02,630
For this reason, Osman deserves nothing.

1247
01:54:03,440 --> 01:54:04,540
Ignoble dog!

1248
01:54:06,540 --> 01:54:07,660
You underestimate us.

1249
01:54:08,160 --> 01:54:12,700
That girl, Alcicek, for whom you
were captured.

1250
01:54:13,940 --> 01:54:15,630
Do you know where she is now?

1251
01:54:15,740 --> 01:54:18,550
I told you not to say her name.

1252
01:54:19,290 --> 01:54:20,250
At the wedding.

1253
01:54:22,920 --> 01:54:27,270
It means that you are not that valuable.

1254
01:54:27,580 --> 01:54:29,550
Do you really expect me to believe that?

1255
01:54:33,290 --> 01:54:34,220
What a pity.

1256
01:54:36,470 --> 01:54:37,520
Too bad.

1257
01:54:40,500 --> 01:54:42,970
While you are slowly dying here...

1258
01:54:44,440 --> 01:54:45,570
...she is getting married.

1259
01:54:50,030 --> 01:54:52,150
I'll take you from Osman first.

1260
01:54:53,700 --> 01:54:57,180
You will be the first
to be separated from him

1261
01:55:01,530 --> 01:55:03,110
Do you want to say goodbye?

1262
01:55:04,360 --> 01:55:05,690
Will he die that early?

1263
01:55:07,340 --> 01:55:08,880
I was going to skin him.

1264
01:55:14,130 --> 01:55:18,420
I will now send you to hell!

1265
01:55:19,900 --> 01:55:25,970
I bear witness that there is no God but Allah,
and I bear witness that Muhammad is His Messenger

1266
01:55:39,720 --> 01:55:40,520
Uncle!

1267
01:55:40,640 --> 01:55:43,170
Hell is only for people like you!

1268
01:55:44,090 --> 01:55:45,160
Osman!

1269
01:56:17,090 --> 01:56:18,000
Eric

1270
01:56:32,790 --> 01:56:33,430
Come on.

1271
01:57:19,570 --> 01:57:21,210
Never do this.

1272
01:57:21,760 --> 01:57:23,580
Don't do this Osman!

1273
01:57:26,300 --> 01:57:29,650
You will say the same
when my sword is on your neck!

1274
01:57:30,560 --> 01:57:32,560
But I won't back down then either!

1275
01:57:43,910 --> 01:57:44,940
No.

1276
01:57:49,080 --> 01:57:50,230
No!

1277
01:57:57,840 --> 01:57:58,830
Aktemur.

1278
01:58:05,530 --> 01:58:07,680
Aktemur, Aktemur!

1279
01:58:08,200 --> 01:58:09,050
You are fine, right?

1280
01:58:14,450 --> 01:58:15,200
You are fine, right?

1281
01:58:15,730 --> 01:58:17,680
Hold on, hold on.

1282
01:58:17,760 --> 01:58:19,080
Alps, help!

1283
01:58:19,210 --> 01:58:20,510
Come on, we will go to Yenisehir.

1284
01:58:20,730 --> 01:58:21,770
- Boran
- My Bey.

1285
01:58:21,950 --> 01:58:23,940
Our destination will be different.

1286
01:58:24,410 --> 01:58:25,420
Hear me carefully.

1287
01:58:27,500 --> 01:58:29,720
Constantinople
Palace of the Emperor

1288
01:58:36,650 --> 01:58:40,670
Who stopped the army
that I sent to help Commander Olof?

1289
01:58:41,200 --> 01:58:42,330
Which of you?

1290
01:58:45,200 --> 01:58:45,980
Sir.

1291
01:58:47,780 --> 01:58:50,000
- Emperor Andronicus...
- It's you!

1292
01:58:51,630 --> 01:58:53,350
You are the one who stopped them.

1293
01:59:00,670 --> 01:59:01,660
Tell me.

1294
01:59:04,170 --> 01:59:05,740
Where is Andronicus?

1295
01:59:08,510 --> 01:59:09,470
Absent.

1296
01:59:11,270 --> 01:59:12,780
Who is in his place?

1297
01:59:14,990 --> 01:59:16,010
I am.

1298
01:59:20,920 --> 01:59:22,880
You no longer serve the Byzantine state.

1299
01:59:24,770 --> 01:59:27,330
In order to prove your loyalty towards me...

1300
01:59:29,100 --> 01:59:30,870
...I command you to kill this traitor.

1301
01:59:34,230 --> 01:59:35,190
Immediately.

1302
01:59:48,000 --> 01:59:50,390
Who knows for
how long you have been friends?

1303
01:59:53,180 --> 01:59:55,880
You killed him without asking
a single question

1304
01:59:56,640 --> 01:59:59,530
without even objecting!

1305
02:00:02,370 --> 02:00:03,990
can I trust you?

1306
02:00:04,930 --> 02:00:06,030
Yes sir.

1307
02:00:07,230 --> 02:00:08,300
Nice.

1308
02:00:24,050 --> 02:00:25,900
All armies are under your command.

1309
02:00:26,470 --> 02:00:30,380
I'd like you to send one of
your best units to Olof at once.

1310
02:00:32,700 --> 02:00:33,640
Marcus!

1311
02:00:34,020 --> 02:00:34,820
Yes sir.

1312
02:00:34,900 --> 02:00:37,660
Bring all the agreements
that Andronikos made with Osman.

1313
02:00:37,980 --> 02:00:38,930
Immediately.

1314
02:00:38,930 --> 02:00:39,870
Yes sir.

1315
02:01:36,860 --> 02:01:38,460
Yes, Mr. Olof

1316
02:01:40,040 --> 02:01:43,550
You didn't pay the necessary attention.

1317
02:01:47,470 --> 02:01:49,980
You couldn't handle a single Subasi!

1318
02:01:51,550 --> 02:01:53,740
We gave you a mission!

1319
02:01:54,550 --> 02:01:56,860
You failed miserably!

1320
02:02:09,910 --> 02:02:13,000
Well, we didn't say anything!

1321
02:02:14,700 --> 02:02:16,940
We've already made Subasi
worse than dead!

1322
02:02:18,240 --> 02:02:19,820
Until he gets on his feet...

1323
02:02:20,320 --> 02:02:23,100
...I'll take my Hatun
and start a living in my tent.

1324
02:02:27,200 --> 02:02:30,940
Now that you had a wedding,
why did you come here?

1325
02:02:35,130 --> 02:02:37,430
It is the order of Ismihan Sultani.

1326
02:02:38,060 --> 02:02:42,790
She was very angry that you
missed Subasi.

1327
02:02:46,920 --> 02:02:48,150
I calmed her down.

1328
02:02:52,050 --> 02:02:53,000
Right now...

1329
02:02:54,920 --> 02:02:58,120
Until news comes from the Mother Sultan...

1330
02:02:58,370 --> 02:03:01,200
...you will never move a single movement.

1331
02:03:03,760 --> 02:03:04,870
I came to say this.

1332
02:03:07,340 --> 02:03:09,200
As long as she gives me what I want...

1333
02:03:11,360 --> 02:03:13,820
...I will do what Ismihan Sultan says.

1334
02:03:16,180 --> 02:03:19,370
Go tell her this.

1335
02:03:21,470 --> 02:03:22,140
Hussein!

1336
02:03:23,320 --> 02:03:24,660
Good, let's go now.

1337
02:03:25,730 --> 02:03:28,390
Groom shall not keep
the bride waiting.

1338
02:03:28,530 --> 02:03:29,510
Come on.

1339
02:04:16,860 --> 02:04:19,110
My heart burns whenever
I see you like this.

1340
02:04:20,740 --> 02:04:23,650
Why do you torture yourself, Alcicek Hatun?

1341
02:04:28,210 --> 02:04:31,510
I thought I had my back
on a mountain that wouldn't fall.

1342
02:04:35,010 --> 02:04:36,170
That mountain fell.

1343
02:04:37,360 --> 02:04:38,810
I was crushed under it.

1344
02:04:44,740 --> 02:04:45,910
I died, Esma.

1345
02:04:48,310 --> 02:04:50,040
Let it happen, whatever it is.

1346
02:04:55,320 --> 02:04:59,270
Get up, get up now!
Run away!

1347
02:05:00,980 --> 02:05:02,450
Don't do this to yourself.

1348
02:05:04,450 --> 02:05:06,380
I am okay with my destiny Esma.

1349
02:05:07,780 --> 02:05:09,330
Don't be sad anymore.

1350
02:05:29,800 --> 02:05:31,020
My beautiful daughter

1351
02:05:35,080 --> 02:05:36,530
You are very pretty.

1352
02:05:54,910 --> 02:06:00,020
Not a single tear shall fall from
those beautiful eyes of yours any more.

1353
02:06:03,010 --> 02:06:06,800
Whatever you did, I
did it for your own good.

1354
02:06:08,800 --> 02:06:10,120
Do not forget this.

1355
02:07:02,800 --> 02:07:04,170
This way, my Bey

1356
02:07:04,450 --> 02:07:05,550
please enter

1357
02:07:10,700 --> 02:07:12,900
We got what we wanted, right, Hussein?

1358
02:07:12,900 --> 02:07:14,300
Yes my Bey.

1359
02:07:14,300 --> 02:07:16,570
Praise be! Praise be!

1360
02:07:16,570 --> 02:07:20,020
Has there been anything
I couldn't get when I wanted?

1361
02:07:20,950 --> 02:07:22,120
My Sultan.

1362
02:07:25,870 --> 02:07:28,300
We are glad you came.

1363
02:07:29,050 --> 02:07:30,820
Greetings, Bayindir.

1364
02:07:32,070 --> 02:07:34,270
Masha Allah, everyone is here.

1365
02:07:37,500 --> 02:07:39,020
Where is Osman Bey?

1366
02:07:40,250 --> 02:07:42,500
We have sent him news.

1367
02:07:42,500 --> 02:07:43,900
But I don't know if he will come.

1368
02:07:43,900 --> 02:07:45,900
My Sultan.

1369
02:07:46,120 --> 02:07:48,270
Is this reasonable?

1370
02:07:49,050 --> 02:07:50,950
The huge Bey.

1371
02:07:51,600 --> 02:07:57,570
Is he leaving his two important Beys alone
on this remarkable day?

1372
02:08:04,920 --> 02:08:06,620
You see that, right, Beys?

1373
02:08:08,900 --> 02:08:12,950
Not everyone deserves to be statesmen

1374
02:08:14,470 --> 02:08:18,450
If you are a Bey, you should
put your personal matters aside.

1375
02:08:23,370 --> 02:08:27,350
In fact, you know Osman much
better than we do, Turgut Bey.

1376
02:08:28,970 --> 02:08:31,170
You supported him for years.

1377
02:08:32,170 --> 02:08:35,600
He erased you
with his arrogance.

1378
02:08:37,820 --> 02:08:43,100
It's not important for you if he joins
our wedding or not.

1379
02:09:05,150 --> 02:09:07,200
Osman Bey is coming.

1380
02:09:23,300 --> 02:09:25,420
Peace be open you.

1381
02:09:25,420 --> 02:09:27,800
And may peace be upon you.

1382
02:09:31,250 --> 02:09:35,300
What is it?
Weren't you expecting us?

1383
02:09:35,300 --> 02:09:37,300
Welcome my Bey.

1384
02:09:37,300 --> 02:09:39,300
We didn't know you would come.

1385
02:09:39,300 --> 02:09:44,570
But you acted maturely.

1386
02:09:45,450 --> 02:09:46,570
May Allah bless you.

1387
02:09:49,450 --> 02:09:52,750
Where is our bride?

1388
02:09:54,400 --> 02:09:56,500
She is coming now, Malhun Hatun.

1389
02:09:58,870 --> 02:10:00,100
Okay then.

1390
02:10:03,070 --> 02:10:05,250
Let's sit here.

1391
02:10:15,770 --> 02:10:18,070
Malhun, come on.

1392
02:10:35,620 --> 02:10:37,600
Allah bless my daughter

1393
02:10:38,100 --> 02:10:39,270
My Alcicek.

1394
02:10:40,070 --> 02:10:43,320
Your fate is as beautiful as your face.

1395
02:10:47,450 --> 02:10:49,800
Osman Bey has come, Bengi Hatun.

1396
02:10:53,870 --> 02:10:56,870
So you came Osman.

1397
02:10:59,000 --> 02:11:00,670
I will check them.

1398
02:11:22,600 --> 02:11:24,100
Come on.

1399
02:11:30,670 --> 02:11:34,100
Alcicek, praise be!
We are leaving.

1400
02:11:34,100 --> 02:11:36,100
Bala Hatun, where are we going?

1401
02:11:36,100 --> 02:11:37,100
What is going on here?

1402
02:11:37,100 --> 02:11:39,970
Hurry up, we'll take you to Aktemur.

1403
02:11:39,970 --> 02:11:41,820
Aktemur, the one who left me?

1404
02:11:41,820 --> 02:11:43,470
Ah! I will shout now!

1405
02:11:43,470 --> 02:11:45,470
Girl, that man faced death for you!

1406
02:11:46,600 --> 02:11:50,320
While Aktemur was on his way to you,
the enemy captured him.

1407
02:11:50,320 --> 02:11:52,320
He is now unconscious.

1408
02:11:53,320 --> 02:11:55,520
Are you saying the truth, Bala Hatun?

1409
02:11:55,520 --> 02:11:57,400
- But...
- There is no but.

1410
02:11:57,400 --> 02:12:01,100
Alcicek, you are not interested
in this marriage.

1411
02:12:01,100 --> 02:12:03,100
I know you just have to.

1412
02:12:04,500 --> 02:12:07,570
But as long as we are in this country...

1413
02:12:07,570 --> 02:12:09,570
...no one will be forced into marriage.

1414
02:12:10,300 --> 02:12:12,310
Your mother will come now, girl, come on!

1415
02:12:12,310 --> 02:12:14,800
I know from day one that you like Actimore
, right?

1416
02:12:14,800 --> 02:12:17,220
If you say it still is, so be it

1417
02:12:17,220 --> 02:12:19,020
- Is it true what you say?
- Yes

1418
02:12:19,020 --> 02:12:21,020
No, we're kidding

1419
02:12:21,020 --> 02:12:22,300
God forgive us

1420
02:12:22,300 --> 02:12:24,300
It's true what we say girl, come on

1421
02:12:24,600 --> 02:12:26,300
- Come on!
- Come on!

1422
02:12:39,720 --> 02:12:43,120
- Who accompanies Osman Bey?
- Malhun Hatun and his alps.

1423
02:12:47,800 --> 02:12:49,920
Is Bala Hatun not there?

1424
02:12:49,920 --> 02:12:51,920
Where is she?

1425
02:12:54,000 --> 02:12:56,800
If Bala Hatun is not with him...

1426
02:12:57,900 --> 02:13:00,610
This means that Osman
did not come to congratulate.

1427
02:13:03,270 --> 02:13:05,050
They will kidnap Alcicek!

1428
02:13:05,320 --> 02:13:06,670
Run!

1429
02:13:34,020 --> 02:13:35,570
Tell the alps!

1430
02:13:35,570 --> 02:13:37,150
Close the doors immediately!

1431
02:13:37,150 --> 02:13:39,150
Come on.

1432
02:13:47,850 --> 02:13:49,400
Open the door.

1433
02:13:54,070 --> 02:13:55,270
Break it.

1434
02:14:01,400 --> 02:14:03,200
Don't do this, Alcicek.

1435
02:14:04,500 --> 02:14:06,950
Don't do this to us.

1436
02:14:06,950 --> 02:14:08,950
Don't, my daughter.

1437
02:14:11,000 --> 02:14:12,800
Alcicek!

1438
02:14:18,950 --> 02:14:21,550
The passage that will lead us out
is here, Bala Hatun.

1439
02:14:21,550 --> 02:14:22,520
Let's hurry.

1440
02:14:22,520 --> 02:14:23,870
Good.

1441
02:14:23,870 --> 02:14:26,070
Ulgen, you inform Osman Bey.

1442
02:14:26,070 --> 02:14:26,920
Come on.

1443
02:14:26,920 --> 02:14:28,920
Come on, Alcicek.

1444
02:14:39,850 --> 02:14:43,460
Did you think that we would
turn our backs on you...

1445
02:14:43,460 --> 02:14:47,050
...because we could not take the girl,
Ismihan Sultan?

1446
02:14:47,600 --> 02:14:50,870
You surprise me very much, Osman Bey.

1447
02:15:03,600 --> 02:15:05,220
No.

1448
02:15:06,500 --> 02:15:08,520
Don't ever be surprised.

1449
02:15:10,750 --> 02:15:13,350
You haven't seen anything yet.

1450
02:15:17,050 --> 02:15:18,470
I see that...

1451
02:15:19,900 --> 02:15:22,550
...my presence disturbs you a lot.

1452
02:15:32,320 --> 02:15:35,350
And you're looking at me curiously
about what I'm going to say.

1453
02:15:36,900 --> 02:15:40,170
I hope you haven't done anything wrong.

1454
02:15:40,270 --> 02:15:42,720
What is wrong for you is right for us.

1455
02:15:43,800 --> 02:15:48,370
You will not be able to
pay for your actions.

1456
02:15:49,570 --> 02:15:53,320
There is none among you
who can make me pay any price.

1457
02:15:56,300 --> 02:16:08,920
Your tricks, betrayals and sedition cannot
make us lose anything from our hearts!

1458
02:16:11,020 --> 02:16:14,800
Neither love nor patriotism!

1459
02:16:17,220 --> 02:16:19,370
Oktem Bey!

1460
02:16:21,800 --> 02:16:24,320
They have kidnapped Alcicek!

1461
02:16:32,469 --> 02:16:35,420
Alcicek and Aktemur are
going to marry tomorrow.

1462
02:16:36,270 --> 02:16:37,670
Soldiers!

1463
02:16:44,100 --> 02:16:46,020
Alps.

1464
02:16:53,920 --> 02:16:59,629
In Inegol Castle, where Gunduz Bey
watered the land with his blood.

1465
02:17:05,284 --> 02:17:09,674
We invite you all to our wedding.

1466
02:17:12,510 --> 02:17:24,719
Please contact turkision@gmail.com for any inquiries